{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GsnzxSzaNdc96NHBEMJTJk","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (55.1KB). Full output saved to: /Users/kalethabh/.claude/projects/-Users-kalethabh-Anuncios-con-IA/c80ac761-4344-4193-8afa-0134bff4b938/tool-results/toolu_01GsnzxSzaNdc96NHBEMJTJk.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n{\"requestId\":\"0dd7e64e-4a69-4537-b130-175fb315dd3e\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1562268411536722\",\"collationId\":\"943476014714479\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-23T02:59:39.936Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-03-22T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-04-05T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":14,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/5152045a4b235375af555ff9a7931f688b05bf2a930e929193a8cd82e5ba5d13.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c42d61a7218157e1c27d447aabb5f5037a95ea570af6597b2704d496aecd473b.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"448681665003838\",\"name\":\"James Rean - Natural Wellness\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/448681665003838.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"448681665003838\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":62223,\"countriesCount\":20,\"facebookLikes\":96,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"You patted it. Joked about it. Then your doctor said fatty liver and the joke stopped.\\n\\nLiver cleanses didn't help. Detox teas didn't help. Months of nothing changing.\\n\\nHere's what fatty liver actually did. It slowed your digestion right down. Waste stopped moving. Backed up. Hardened. Expanded. Your dad bod isn't weight — it's backed-up waste your fatty liver left in your gut for months. Maybe years.\\n\\nWaste doesn't need months to clear. It needs heat.\\n\\nBlocked drain. Pour cleaner down it for weeks — sits on top. Hit it with hot water and the blockage clears in minutes.\\n\\nAida™ cayenne softgels reignite your body with capsaicin heat. Waste starts clearing immediately.48 hours — that hard swollen shape softens. Waste moves. You feel lighter than you have in years.\\n\\nFatty liver built it. Aida™ clears it.\\n\\n👇 Tap below to try Aida™\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://officialaidastore.com/pages/listicle-cayenne-swelling\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"officialaidastore.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Fatty Liver Did This\",\"ctaLink\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c80ac761-4344-4193-8afa-0134bff4b938","uuid":"f48c3ed8-84d2-4ddd-9abf-3f76da5f1049","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:45:08.162Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"requestId\":\"0dd7e64e-4a69-4537-b130-175fb315dd3e\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1562268411536722\",\"collationId\":\"943476014714479\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-23T02:59:39.936Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-03-22T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-04-05T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":14,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/5152045a4b235375af555ff9a7931f688b05bf2a930e929193a8cd82e5ba5d13.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c42d61a7218157e1c27d447aabb5f5037a95ea570af6597b2704d496aecd473b.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"448681665003838\",\"name\":\"James Rean - Natural Wellness\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/448681665003838.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"448681665003838\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":62223,\"countriesCount\":20,\"facebookLikes\":96,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"You patted it. Joked about it. Then your doctor said fatty liver and the joke stopped.\\n\\nLiver cleanses didn't help. Detox teas didn't help. Months of nothing changing.\\n\\nHere's what fatty liver actually did. It slowed your digestion right down. Waste stopped moving. Backed up. Hardened. Expanded. Your dad bod isn't weight — it's backed-up waste your fatty liver left in your gut for months. Maybe years.\\n\\nWaste doesn't need months to clear. It needs heat.\\n\\nBlocked drain. Pour cleaner down it for weeks — sits on top. Hit it with hot water and the blockage clears in minutes.\\n\\nAida™ cayenne softgels reignite your body with capsaicin heat. Waste starts clearing immediately.48 hours — that hard swollen shape softens. Waste moves. You feel lighter than you have in years.\\n\\nFatty liver built it. Aida™ clears it.\\n\\n👇 Tap below to try Aida™\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://officialaidastore.com/pages/listicle-cayenne-swelling\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"officialaidastore.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Fatty Liver Did This\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":37,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AT\",\"BE\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IT\",\"MX\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"IE\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_4369958513325658\",\"collationId\":\"1903838506913204\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-15T04:15:00.240Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-03-14T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-05-23T00:58:22.698Z\",\"daysRunning\":255,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/040a13eb6937de6ea3182e73737975d75f7fb02ece07163429fd7226ebd8fab1.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"2001528746805521\",\"name\":\"Mark Zillmann\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/2001528746805521.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"2001528746805521\",\"liveAdsCount\":52,\"reach30d\":18928,\"totalReach\":428222,\"countriesCount\":7,\"facebookLikes\":33,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Why these cayenne pepper softgels so F*CKING expensive?\\n\\nThat was my first thought too.\\n\\nClicked off immediately. Went back to my $4 generic sildenafil order from some Indian manufacturer I'd never heard of.\\n\\nBut the Aurivita ads kept coming.\\n\\nFine. I'll figure out why it costs that much just to tell myself it's not worth it.\\n\\nFirst thing I noticed — 240 softgels per bag. I kept looking for the catch. That's a 2 month supply. Not the 30-day bait-and-switch I was expecting.\\n\\nSo I did the maths. Roughly $2 a day.\\n\\nMeanwhile I'd been spending $40 a pill on branded Viagra. Planning every intimate moment around a 45 minute window. Carrying pills in my wallet like a teenager with a condom he hopes he'll need.\\n\\nThen I looked up why it actually costs what it costs.\\n\\nThird party lab tested. Not \\\"we tested it ourselves and wrote nice things.\\\" An independent lab. Verified dosage. Verified purity. The capsaicin research behind this only works at a specific therapeutic dose — 3mg per serving from 30,000 HU cayenne. Under-dosed and you've just bought expensive spice.\\n\\nManufactured in an FDA registered facility. Not a basement in Guangzhou. Not the same factories making 90% of the generic sildenafil that gets shipped from India with limited batch quality control.\\n\\nI started thinking about what I'd actually been putting in my body for 18 months.\\n\\nFour dollar pills from a manufacturer I'd never looked up. No idea what was actually in them. No idea if the dose was what it said. Just cheap and available and it sort of worked most of the time.\\n\\nI ordered the cayenne softgels.\\n\\nWeek 3, I woke up with morning wood. Full strength. Hadn't happened naturally in over a year.\\n\\nWeek 6, date night. No sildenafil. Just wanted to see what would happen.\\n\\nEverything worked. Properly. Spontaneously. The way it used to before I started needing pharmaceutical help just to feel normal.\\n\\nShe noticed. Didn't say anything directly. Just looked at me differently.\\n\\nI've now been off sildenafil completely for 11 weeks.\\n\\nThe bag in the photo is empty because I finished it. Already ordered the next one.\\n\\nIs it expensive? Compared to a $4 pill that does nothing but force your blood vessels open for 4 hours while the actual problem gets worse — yeah, I thought so too.\\n\\nCompared to what I was actually spending on sildenafil every month, knowing I'd need it forever?\\n\\nIt's the cheapest thing I've bought in two years.\\n\\n120-day money back guarantee. They wouldn't offer that if it didn't work.\\n\\nAurivita. I was wrong about the price.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"http://aurivita.co/pages/adv-3\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"guys, this stuff works!\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Discover the strength of capsaicin.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":744,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":7,\"duplicates\":17,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":1},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"MX\",\"NZ\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":47,\"currentRank\":47,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":90.38},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1668681627614900\",\"collationId\":\"1640189821167784\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-22T01:05:56.626Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-21T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-13T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":84,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/e8ecb8f2c5d884cade5e68dfb9f829c860e4f05b8049a1909f711f214734219a.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"999923659862342\",\"name\":\"Get Jacked\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/999923659862342.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"999923659862342\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":83140,\"totalReach\":1348637,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":506,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"If your energy is gone by noon, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf your legs feel heavy and your body feels older than it should, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf your circulation is sluggish, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf your stamina is not what it used to be, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf you feel winded doing things that never used to slow you down, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf you are over 40 and wake up already drained, take cayenne.\\n\\nThrow away the detox teas, energy drinks, and trendy supplements. Listen to me carefully.\\n\\nJust focus on getting real cayenne pepper in the right form.\\n\\nDrinking cayenne shots or sprinkling powder on food is not the same as taking concentrated cayenne softgels. Your stomach acid destroys most of it before it reaches your bloodstream.\\n\\nNow you might ask, why cayenne?\\n\\nBecause cayenne pepper activates something called the TRPV1 receptor. The 2021 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine was awarded for discovering this exact pathway. When TRPV1 is activated, your body releases nitric oxide, which relaxes blood vessels, improves circulation, and restores the steady energy your body is supposed to have. As you age, this pathway slows down. Cayenne wakes it back up.\\n\\nBut before you go buy any cayenne supplement, there is one thing you need to know. Most capsules hit your stomach, burn for ten minutes, and do nothing for your blood vessels. The delivery method matters. Oil-encapsulated softgels bypass the stomach acid and deliver 6 to 8 hours of sustained release directly where it counts.\\n\\nGetJacked delivers 3,000mg equivalent of cayenne per serving in oil-encapsulated softgels. Plus Korean Red Ginseng, Beetroot Powder, and BioPerine for maximum absorption. Nothing else.\\n\\n2,847 verified customers. 4.8 out of 5 stars. 120-day money-back guarantee. BOGO offer available today. Tap below while it is still in stock.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://get-jacked.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"get-jacked.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Support Your Circulation and Energy Every Day\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Get Jacked\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":12,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1273250125003578\",\"collationId\":\"928142710050371\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-01T05:41:10.032Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-04-30T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-05-02T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":2,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/59dadf1c04f9a3d0d70a5b6a7665b42ce110becb8c1f8ba55ebe560c0b705a4f.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/b7d97143224df620611acf891f6477e67e777a76b40c0ebd8b12ac892b0b16ab.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"414649768408827\",\"name\":\"Brandon Trevor - Men's Wellness & Health\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/414649768408827.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"414649768408827\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":6164,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":2500,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Stop. Think about your beer belly. It's been there for years. You've trained. Dieted. Cut back on beer. Hasn't moved. Not once.\\n\\nHave you ever considered it's not a beer belly at all?\\n\\nWhen was the last time you had a proper movement? Two days ago? Three? Five? That belly is days of backed-up waste your body never cleared. Not beer. Not fat. Waste stacking on top of itself.\\n\\nYour body went cold. Digestion shut down. Food goes in. Nothing comes out on time. Sits there. Hardens. Expands. Pushes your belly out further every day it doesn't move.\\n\\nLike a rubbish bag you forgot to take out. Day one it's fine. Day three it's full. Day five it's overflowing. Your gut is that bag. It just needs emptying.\\n\\nAida™ Cayenne Softgels reignite your body with capsaicin heat. Gut switches on. Waste moves. Days of buildup finally clears.\\n\\n48 hours. The belly you spent years fighting empties in 48 hours.\\n\\n👇 Tap below to try Aida™ Cayenne Softgels\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aidaformen.com/pages/mens-gut-health\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aidaformen.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"It's Not Beer. It's Waste.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":10,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CA\",\"GB\",\"IE\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"IE\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1398257971663449\",\"collationId\":\"1536445670954682\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-04T22:08:35.521Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2025-12-04T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-04-30T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":147,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/0ec733032340a80de72e065cb8ea186a9729e732587dee4e2b2e2a3a5ceb3ac0.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/d1f7945600ed5c9d0f67a6f022d2cd9bd5840d51c253cf9770a791b804656f7a.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"106019702360504\",\"name\":\"Chaya Stanton\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/106019702360504.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"106019702360504\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":47,\"totalReach\":202942,\"countriesCount\":9,\"facebookLikes\":133,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"🔥 Tired, heavy legs?\\nOur cayenne softgels help support healthy veins & better blood flow from the inside out 🚶\u200d♀️💨\\nWith D3+K2, Vitamin E + herbal extracts for heart & vessel support ❤️✨\\nFeel lighter. Move easier. Live stronger 💪😊\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"ORDER NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://retrowave.online/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels-supplement-supports-leg-vein-heart-and-blood-vessel-health-with-vitamin-e-d3-k2-and-extracts-of-grape-seed-hawthorn-beetroot-berberine-and-others240-softgels-1-bag?utm_source=facebook&utm_campaign=SUN-辣椒油-USCAUK-251204&utm_medium=socialad\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"retrowave.online\",\"ctaDescription\":\"CODE:2DOLLAROFF\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":9,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"BE\",\"CA\",\"DE\",\"GB\",\"IE\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1297641448648638\",\"collationId\":\"1425597369585743\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-26T11:51:31.818Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-25T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-10-02T11:20:13.427Z\",\"daysRunning\":130,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/7ede120fce4bbc1b54aefcf67edf6fb02a98f8373dca6c4cf2ef4da6c96a889e.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"273499155839632\",\"name\":\"Leg Cramp Reset\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/273499155839632.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"273499155839632\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":14229,\"totalReach\":170109,\"countriesCount\":6,\"facebookLikes\":12,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"I had a leg problem on a Mediterranean cruise. The ship's doctor was from Austria. He asked me ONE question that made my American cardiologist look 15 years behind.\\n\\nI'm 58 years old.\\n\\nMy wife and I saved for two years for this cruise. Two weeks through the Mediterranean. Greece, Italy, Spain.\\n\\nDay four, we're walking through Santorini.\\n\\nCobblestone streets. Steep hills. Beautiful.\\n\\nBut my closed-toe walking shoes are killing me. My calves — cramping at night for three years now, statin-medicated for six, on metformin for four — start gripping with every incline. The muscle is so tight that even gentle walking sends it into a vice.\\n\\nBy the time we get back to the ship, my left calf has locked up completely. I'm dragging my foot up the gangway. There's a tightness that won't release.\\n\\nMy wife looks worried. \\\"We need to get that looked at.\\\"\\n\\nI don't want anyone looking at my legs. I haven't told anyone how bad the night cramping has gotten in three years. Not a doctor I didn't have to see. Not my wife in plain conversation. I've been doing the choreography in the dark — jumping out of bed, stumbling, walking it off, sliding back in — and pretending the next morning that I slept fine.\\n\\nBut the pain is bad enough that I don't have a choice.\\n\\nThe next morning, I go to the ship's concierge.\\n\\n\\\"I need to see a doctor about my legs.\\\"\\n\\nShe makes a call. Gets me an appointment that afternoon with the ship's physician.\\n\\nHis office is small. Clean. On Deck 3 near the medical center.\\n\\nDr. Werner. Austrian accent. Maybe mid-50s.\\n\\nHe examines my calf. Checks the pulses in my feet. Tests temperature.\\n\\n\\\"The immediate issue is the spasm from the shoe pressure and the walking,\\\" he says. \\\"But these vessels are showing significant constriction. How long have you been treating this?\\\"\\n\\n\\\"About three years,\\\" I say. \\\"My GP back home has me on magnesium. Every night. Plus quinine for a while until my heart started skipping beats.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"Has he discussed TRPV1-mediated vasodilation for your condition?\\\"\\n\\nI stare at him.\\n\\n\\\"What's that?\\\"\\n\\nHe looks at me for a moment. Then sets down his instruments.\\n\\n\\\"Your blood vessel walls are lined with endothelial cells,\\\" he says. \\\"After 50, they produce less and less nitric oxide. The molecule that signals your vessels to open. Less than 3% of any oral magnesium reaches the smooth muscle controlling those vessels in chronic cases like yours.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"But the bigger issue is underneath. Your statin and your metformin are doing their jobs on cholesterol and blood sugar. But neither one signals your vessels to open. Neither one restores the nitric oxide. Every magnesium tablet you swallow targets the muscle cells. The fraction that helps hits the wrong cells. The constriction is behind two barriers your tablets were never designed to penetrate.\\\"\\n\\nI'm listening. But I don't understand why my cardiologist never explained this.\\n\\n\\\"My cardiologist never said anything about TRPV1 receptors.\\\"\\n\\nDr. Werner nods slowly.\\n\\n\\\"It's not commonly discussed in American cardiology practice,\\\" he says. \\\"Most focus on cholesterol management and electrolyte protocols, with quinine or Pletal as the escalation. But in European vascular medicine, TRPV1-mediated vasodilation has been understood for over a decade.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"So what do I do?\\\" I ask.\\n\\n\\\"There's extensive research on capsaicin,\\\" he says. \\\"The compound in cayenne pepper, at concentrated dose, that enters the bloodstream and activates TRPV1 receptors on the inner vessel wall. Forces nitric oxide release directly into the vessel. Bypassing the muscle cells entirely. Paired with Korean ginseng to sustain the release for hours instead of minutes. It's been showing significant results for chronic nighttime cramping. Especially in patients on statins or metformin who've failed magnesium protocols.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"My cardiologist never mentioned anything like that.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"It's well-established in European clinical practice,\\\" he says. \\\"But not standard protocol yet in the US. If I were you, I'd look into it when you get home.\\\"\\n\\nHe paused. Then added:\\n\\n\\\"Three years on magnesium that achieves 3% effective penetration is not treatment. It's monitoring the decline.\\\"\\n\\nI thank him and leave.\\n\\nBut I can't stop thinking about it.\\n\\nFor the rest of the cruise, it's in the back of my mind.\\n\\nThree years. My cardiologist had been adjusting my magnesium dose. Adding quinine. Pulling me off when my heart started skipping. Watching the cramping spread from once a week to four times a week.\\n\\nTelling me to keep taking it.\\n\\nBut he never once mentioned that my vessels themselves had stopped responding and that magnesium can't fix that.\\n\\nOr that my body had lost the ability to release nitric oxide and was getting worse every year on the statin and the metformin.\\n\\nOr that there was research on triggering vasodilation directly through the bloodstream.\\n\\nWhen we got home, I couldn't let it go.\\n\\nThe night we unpacked, I opened my laptop.\\n\\nIt was 11:45 PM.\\n\\nI started searching.\\n\\n\\\"TRPV1 receptor capsaicin nitric oxide\\\"\\n\\n\\\"systemic capsaicin nighttime leg cramps\\\"\\n\\n\\\"European protocol cayenne pepper circulation\\\"\\n\\nAt 1:30 AM, I found it.\\n\\nPeer-reviewed vascular research. Published in clinical journals.\\n\\nStudy after study confirming exactly what Dr. Werner had told me.\\n\\nOral muscle supplements achieve less than 3% vascular effect in chronic cases. Endothelial dysfunction increases vessel constriction with age, statins, and diabetes medication. Capsaicin from concentrated cayenne demonstrates direct TRPV1 activation. Korean ginseng sustains the nitric oxide release for hours. Both delivered systemically through the bloodstream.\\n\\nThe research was there. Published. Peer-reviewed. Some of it over a decade old.\\n\\nI read the studies three times.\\n\\nI felt something rising in my chest.\\n\\nNot anger. Something else.\\n\\nDisbelief, maybe.\\n\\nMy cardiologist had been prescribing magnesium since 2021.\\n\\nThree years.\\n\\nAnd there was published research, from before he ever started treating me, showing that magnesium can't reach the vessels and that systemic TRPV1 activation could address the actual barrier.\\n\\nWhy hadn't he mentioned it?\\n\\nI kept reading.\\n\\nForum threads on Mayo Clinic Connect. HealthUnlocked. Diabetes.co.uk. Men describing the exact same 3am ritual. Jump out of bed. Stumble in the dark. Walk it off. Slide back in. Don't move.\\n\\nOne man had written: \\\"I wake up screaming. My wife thinks I've lost my mind. Tried quinine, magnesium, you name it. Nothing touches it.\\\"\\n\\nAnother, on atorvastatin: \\\"My leg cramps are totally related to the statin use. My GP dismisses the connection.\\\"\\n\\nAnother, on metformin: \\\"So bad I wake up crying out. Have severe muscle pain from the cramping for days. My doctor won't test my B12.\\\"\\n\\nSame mechanism. Same results. Same dismissal from doctors.\\n\\nAt 2:50 AM, I started looking for products.\\n\\nMost cayenne supplements were garbage. Generic powder at 5-10% capsaicin. Nowhere near the standardization the research used. And almost none of them paired cayenne with Korean ginseng for sustained release.\\n\\nBut I found one company making a pharmaceutical-grade formulation. Get Jacked. Concentrated Cayenne Softgels with standardized capsaicin. Korean Ginseng for sustained nitric oxide release. Oil-based softgels for systemic delivery.\\n\\nI read the reviews. Men describing exactly what I was going through. Years of magnesium that never reached the vessels. Then warm feet and full nights of sleep within weeks of switching to systemic delivery.\\n\\nI ordered a pouch at 3:15 AM.\\n\\nWhen it arrived, I started immediately.\\n\\nFour softgels with breakfast. No stretching first. No creams. No compression. No quinine.\\n\\nTen seconds. Done.\\n\\nWeek one: The cold feet, that ice-cold sensation at the end of every day, were calmer. Something was reaching the vessels from inside. About thirty minutes after the first dose, my hands were warm. Visible enough I checked my watch.\\n\\nWeek two: I lay in bed at 11pm and noticed my left calf wasn't tight. The first night in over a year. Soft. Relaxed.\\n\\nWeek four: I walked the dog around the block without my calf locking up. Three trips. The cramping had stopped. The cold was normalizing. No 2am wake-ups all week.\\n\\nWeek eight: I took a photo of myself on a Saturday morning walk and compared it to one from two months earlier.\\n\\nThe difference was visible.\\n\\nI'd walked over 4 kilometers that morning. The dragging foot was gone. The cramping was gone. No new wake-ups that month. The decline had stopped.\\n\\nAt three months, I went back to my regular cardiologist.\\n\\nHe examined my legs.\\n\\nThen he stopped.\\n\\n\\\"Your circulation hasn't deteriorated,\\\" he said. \\\"Actually, the pedal pulses are significantly improved. That's unusual on magnesium protocol alone, especially with you still on the statin and metformin.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"I stopped the magnesium three months ago.\\\"\\n\\nHis head came up. \\\"You stopped?\\\"\\n\\n\\\"I found something else. A softgel. Pharmaceutical-grade cayenne and Korean ginseng. Systemic delivery through the bloodstream. Activates the receptors my magnesium couldn't reach.\\\"\\n\\nMy cardiologist looked at my chart.\\n\\n\\\"I'm not familiar with that approach,\\\" he said. \\\"But the results speak for themselves. Keep doing whatever you're doing.\\\"\\n\\nI left his office feeling something I hadn't felt in years.\\n\\nNot angry. Not betrayed.\\n\\nJust aware.\\n\\nMy cardiologist wasn't hiding anything from me.\\n\\nHe just didn't know.\\n\\nThe research existed. The studies were published. The results were documented.\\n\\nBut it wasn't part of his training. It wasn't standard protocol in American cardiology.\\n\\nSo he did what he was taught: prescribe magnesium, adjust the dose, add quinine, consider Pletal or surgery if symptoms get severe.\\n\\nMeanwhile, in European vascular medicine, they'd been using systemic TRPV1 activation as a treatment approach for over a decade.\\n\\nI'm 59 now.\\n\\nMy legs are walking again. My nights are quiet.\\n\\nAnd I think about that cruise ship doctor all the time.\\n\\nThe one who took ten minutes to explain what's inside my blood vessels. What TRPV1 does. Why magnesium can't reach the vessels. Why my statin and metformin were doing their jobs on cholesterol and blood sugar but couldn't open the vessels themselves.\\n\\nSomething my cardiologist had never mentioned in three years.\\n\\nIf your cardiologist is prescribing magnesium and quinine and telling you to \\\"be patient\\\" with no improvement after months or years, you need to know something.\\n\\nThe research exists.\\n\\nPublished vascular studies. Peer-reviewed clinical data. Showing that oral muscle supplements achieve less than 3% vascular effect and that systemic capsaicin at pharmaceutical-grade concentration can activate the receptors that signal vessels to open.\\n\\nYour cardiologist probably hasn't seen it.\\n\\nNot because he's incompetent.\\n\\nBut because American cardiology training focuses on muscle support and electrolyte protocols.\\n\\nSystemic TRPV1 activation with plant-derived compounds isn't standard protocol yet.\\n\\nSo when your cardiologist says \\\"keep taking the magnesium,\\\" he's telling you what he was trained to recommend.\\n\\nBut he's not telling you about the research that could actually address why the cramping survives behind two barriers his treatments can't reach.\\n\\nThe brand I use is Get Jacked Cayenne Pepper Softgels. Pharmaceutical-grade. Standardized capsaicin. Korean ginseng. Four softgels with breakfast.\\n\\nI don't get anything from sharing this.\\n\\nI just know what it's like to swallow magnesium every night for three years with no improvement.\\n\\nAnd I know what it's like to have a doctor on a cruise ship — someone I met by accident because my calf locked up on a Santorini hill — explain in ten minutes what my cardiologist never mentioned in three years.\\n\\nIf you're being told to \\\"just keep taking it,\\\" you deserve to know there's research your cardiologist might not have seen.\\n\\nResearch that could open the vessels without quinine, without Pletal, without surgery.\\n\\nResearch that's been understood in European vascular medicine for over a decade.\\n\\nYou don't have to wait for your cardiologist to learn about it.\\n\\nYou can look into it yourself.\\n\\n👉 https://www.get-jacked.co/pages/leg-cramp-reset\\n\\n120-day money-back guarantee. If your night cramps don't stop, full refund.\\n\\n— Robert Hayes, 59\\n\\nP.S. — My wife took a photo of me on a hill in Santorini. Closed-toe walking shoes in 90-degree heat while everyone else strolled in sandals. Last month, we walked the boardwalk near our home. Two miles. No stops. She showed me the Santorini photo on her phone afterward and said, \\\"I haven't seen you stop like that in a long time.\\\" I hadn't realized she'd been counting.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://www.get-jacked.co/pages/leg-cramp-reset\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"get-jacked.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"If You Have Cold Feet Or Leg Cramps, You'll Want To Read This 👆\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Leg Cramp Reset CHECK AVAILABILITY NOW Home > Health > Vascular Health Top Vascular Specialist Exposes the $56 Billion Secret the Leg Cramp Industry Doesn’t Want You to Know... Former chronic leg cramp sufferer exposes the $56 billion circulation industry conspiracy – and the 10-second tri...\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":7996,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":72,\"duplicates\":8,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"IE\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":14.29},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_898491979910230\",\"collationId\":\"1516503293469776\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-06T11:30:03.544Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-05T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-27T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":114,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/20f00eea1d6a01b067c0e38b6347a4d91421b39b36c199cbf4d900a073068c9d.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/4a80b859c63dd6eb739f9619c23f3ca883d90c287927c4949f2acf49edc1f71d.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"380391551814486\",\"name\":\"Holistic Knowledge\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/380391551814486.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"380391551814486\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":40113,\"countriesCount\":152,\"facebookLikes\":395,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Your circulation affects everything.\\nYour energy. Your blood pressure. Your hands and feet. Your heart. Your performance. Your brain. Every organ in your body depends on blood moving freely to survive.\\nMost people do not fix their circulation until something goes wrong.\\nRight now you can start fixing it for $17.99.\\nVitalia Cayenne Softgels. High potency capsaicin forcing your vessel walls open. Berberine stabilizing your blood sugar at the root. D3 and K2 clearing the calcium hardening your arteries. Ginseng restoring the energy your poor circulation has been stealing.\\nOver 2,500 people have already felt the difference. Warmer hands and feet within the first week. Steadier energy. Lower blood pressure. Better performance. A body that finally feels like it is running the way it was built to.\\n$17.99. Tonight only. After midnight the price goes back up.\\n30 day money back guarantee. If you feel nothing you pay nothing.\\nThis is the lowest this product will ever be priced.\\n👇 Grab it before tonight.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://vitaliasupplements.co/products/vitalia-cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"vitaliasupplements.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"$17.99 Today Only.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":18619,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":168,\"duplicates\":7,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AQ\",\"AR\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AX\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BL\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BT\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CC\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CN\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CW\",\"CX\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"DM\",\"DO\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FM\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GD\",\"GE\",\"GF\",\"GG\",\"GI\",\"GL\",\"GP\",\"GR\",\"GU\",\"GY\",\"HK\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"JP\",\"KG\",\"KH\",\"KI\",\"KM\",\"KN\",\"KR\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LC\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"MF\",\"MH\",\"MM\",\"MN\",\"MO\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MS\",\"MU\",\"MX\",\"MY\",\"NC\",\"NF\",\"NI\",\"NL\",\"NR\",\"NU\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PA\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PM\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PW\",\"PY\",\"QA\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"SA\",\"SB\",\"SC\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"SH\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SR\",\"ST\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"SY\",\"TC\",\"TH\",\"TK\",\"TL\",\"TM\",\"TO\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TV\",\"TW\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VG\",\"VU\",\"WF\",\"WS\",\"YT\",\"ZA\"],\"mainCountry\":\"ES\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":16.67},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1159650033680867\",\"collationId\":\"2226536271601328\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-16T07:09:28.023Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-15T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-24T12:27:32.566Z\",\"daysRunning\":9,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/8628511dda3991630981747f5b23ff254bd48be54511fe96b330739984fde181.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"698499393345194\",\"name\":\"Could This End Your Sciatica Pain?\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/698499393345194.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"698499393345194\",\"liveAdsCount\":361,\"reach30d\":102415,\"totalReach\":2571709,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":3681,\"instagramFollowers\":15},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"MEN DON'T LOSE THEIR ERECTIONS TO F*CKING \\\"AGE.\\\" They don't lose them to stress. They don't even lose them to low testosterone.\\n\\nThey lose them to something that's been building inside their arteries since their twenties, and almost nobody in this country ever takes the time to tell them about it.\\n\\nI know because it happened to me. And when I finally understood what was going on, I couldn't believe nobody had said a word.\\n\\nDave was 54. He had a \\\"small problem.\\\"\\n\\nThat's it. A small problem. He was fine. Completely fine. Working. Golfing. Living his life.\\n\\nIt just took a little longer than it used to. Didn't always last.\\n\\nTwo years later, his wife is sleeping on the far edge of the bed and he's sitting on the couch at midnight googling things he deletes before morning.\\n\\nTWO YEARS.\\n\\nFrom \\\"it's nothing\\\" to a marriage where nobody touches anybody anymore.\\n\\nAnd nobody told him a thing. Because how do you explain that the system he trusted watched this build inside his arteries for 30 years and just handed him a pill?\\n\\nBecause that's what happens.\\n\\nOver and over and over. Millions of men. And I know EXACTLY what was building inside Dave while every doctor he saw told him it was \\\"normal at his age.\\\"\\n\\nHere's what was actually happening while he felt perfectly fine.\\n\\nEveryone thinks it's testosterone. Everyone thinks it's in your head. That's what the ads say. That's what your buddies joke about. Low T. Stress. Performance anxiety.\\n\\nBut that's not what does it.\\n\\nWhat does it is plumbing.\\n\\nAn erection is blood flow. That's all it is. When you're aroused, the lining of your blood vessels releases nitric oxide. Nitric oxide tells the vessels in your penis to relax and open. Blood rushes in.\\n\\nThat's the whole system.\\n\\nAnd those vessels are TINY. One to two millimeters wide. The ones feeding your heart are three to four.\\n\\nNow here's what nobody in this system will ever explain to you.\\n\\nThe plaque that clogs arteries doesn't start at 50. In 1953, Army pathologists autopsied 300 American soldiers killed in Korea. Average age 22. 77% already had plaque in the arteries of their hearts.\\n\\nTWENTY-TWO.\\n\\nIt starts young. It builds layer by layer. 10 years. 20 years. 30 years. Getting thicker. And the lining of your blood vessels, the part that makes nitric oxide, slowly stops keeping up.\\n\\nYou don't feel it happening.\\n\\nYou feel FINE.\\n\\nUntil you don't.\\n\\nAnd when the smallest arteries in your body finally can't keep up, which ones do you think go first?\\n\\nTHAT is why ED shows up 2 to 5 years before heart symptoms.\\n\\nTHAT is why men in their 40s with ED had roughly 50 times the rate of new heart disease in a large Mayo Clinic study.\\n\\nTHAT is what's behind every \\\"it happens to every guy\\\" your doctor shrugs off.\\n\\nNo awareness campaign. No ribbon. No billboard. Nothing.\\n\\nAnd you need to understand how this works. Because this isn't an accident. This is business.\\n\\nRight now, with just a \\\"small problem,\\\" you're barely worth the system's time. A ten-minute visit. A prescription. Next.\\n\\nThe blue pill doesn't touch your arteries. Not ONE millimeter. It blocks an enzyme for a few hours so blood can force its way through vessels that are already narrowing. When it wears off, you're exactly where you started.\\n\\nSo you keep buying it. $70 a pill for the brand name. Headaches. A red face. A 30-minute window to schedule your own sex life around.\\n\\nFor years. For the rest of your life.\\n\\nAnd by federal law, Medicare drug plans aren't even allowed to cover it. The most common early warning sign of heart disease in men, and you're paying out of pocket to cover it up.\\n\\nAnd you know what makes it even more sick?\\n\\nEvery doctor. Every article. Every website. Every person in a man's life says the same things first.\\n\\nLose the weight. Quit drinking. Cut the stress. Fix your diet. Get to the gym.\\n\\nTHEN we'll talk.\\n\\nA man told me once that admitting this problem to his doctor was harder than admitting he was drinking too much. Another told me he'd rather have a heart attack than tell his wife what was really going on. He was joking. Mostly.\\n\\nAnd that's exactly the problem.\\n\\n\\\"Fix your whole life first\\\" is step one. And for a 55-year-old man working 50 hours a week with a mortgage and a bad back, most men never get past step one. So they never get help. So they accept it. Stop initiating. Roll over at night.\\n\\nAnd the plaque keeps building.\\n\\nAnd the system keeps refilling the prescription.\\n\\nI'm not telling you to overhaul your whole life first.\\n\\nThose things matter. But your blood vessels don't care whether you've earned it. They don't care how many times you've tried and failed. They don't care how embarrassed you are.\\n\\nThe narrowing is there. And it needs support.\\n\\nYou do not need to earn the right to get hard.\\n\\nNow let me tell you what supports it. Because the science has been there for YEARS and the fact that nobody told you about it should make you furious.\\n\\nCapsaicin.\\n\\nThe active compound in cayenne pepper. Used for centuries. Studied for decades. Not a trend. In 2021, the Nobel Prize in Medicine went to the scientist who discovered the receptor capsaicin works on.\\n\\nIt's called TRPV1. And it sits in the lining of your blood vessels.\\n\\nLaboratory research shows that when capsaicin activates it, it switches on the enzyme your vessels use to MAKE nitric oxide.\\n\\nRead that again.\\n\\nThe blue pill holds the signal open for a few hours.\\n\\nCapsaicin works on the step that PRODUCES it.\\n\\nDifferent mechanism. Different point in the same pathway.\\n\\nI'd heard about cayenne for years. Tried it. Bought the capsules. The Amazon garbage.\\n\\nNothing. Except heartburn.\\n\\nI thought it was bullsh*t. For years I thought the whole thing was a scam.\\n\\nI was wrong. And finding out WHY I was wrong made me angrier than anything else.\\n\\nAlmost every cayenne supplement on the market is dry powder in a hard capsule.\\n\\nCapsaicin is fat-soluble. It needs oil to absorb properly. Powder barely does.\\n\\nSo it sits in your stomach. Burns. Gives you heartburn. And most of it never does what it's supposed to.\\n\\nTHAT'S why the capsules don't work. THAT'S why the teas don't work. THAT'S why every man who's tried cayenne thinks it's a scam.\\n\\nThe ingredient was right. Every cheap version they sold you was built wrong.\\n\\nPowder costs pennies to make. Dollars to sell. And when it fails, the man thinks he's tried everything and goes right back to the pill.\\n\\nSomeone built the version that works.\\n\\nCold-extracted heirloom Peruvian cayenne. 300mg per serving. Sealed in avocado oil inside a liquid softgel, so capsaicin is delivered the way it's meant to be absorbed.\\n\\nNo powder. No burn. No heartburn.\\n\\nBack to Dave.\\n\\nHe sat down with his brother-in-law at a barbecue and said something men almost never say out loud.\\n\\n\\\"I know what everyone's gonna tell me. Lose weight. Cut back on beer. I've heard it. I'm not there yet. I just want to stop rolling over at night pretending I'm tired.\\\"\\n\\nThen he said the thing that stuck.\\n\\nHis wife stopped reaching for him. It went from rarely, to almost never, to nothing. She stopped bringing it up.\\n\\nHe said, \\\"I think she's scared that if she asks, I'll have to admit something's wrong. So she just stopped asking.\\\"\\n\\n54 years old. His wife is afraid to touch him.\\n\\nHis brother-in-law handed him a bag of cayenne softgels. Told him: I'm not gonna lecture you. Just take two every morning.\\n\\nTwenty minutes after the first dose, Dave texts him.\\n\\n\\\"Why the f*ck are my hands warm?\\\"\\n\\nThat's circulation, Dave. That's your blood vessels opening up.\\n\\nFour weeks later he calls, losing his mind.\\n\\n\\\"Bro. I woke up with morning wood. I haven't had that in TWO YEARS.\\\"\\n\\nThat's your body's overnight blood flow test, Dave. And you just passed it.\\n\\n\\\"That's been possible this whole time?\\\"\\n\\nYes.\\n\\n\\\"And nobody told me?\\\"\\n\\nNo. Nobody told you.\\n\\nSix weeks in, Dave's not rolling over at night anymore.\\n\\nHis wife reached for him last Saturday. First time in months.\\n\\nShe said, \\\"What's gotten into you?\\\"\\n\\nThen Dave told his brother-in-law something he didn't expect.\\n\\nHe'd booked a heart checkup.\\n\\nNobody told him to. Nobody guilted him. Not because some ad finally scared him.\\n\\nBecause he finally understood what his body had been trying to tell him. If the smallest arteries were struggling, what about the big ones?\\n\\nThat's what got him. Not a lecture. Feeling the difference, and realizing what it meant.\\n\\nDave's still not perfect. He still has his beer on Fridays. That's his call.\\n\\nBut his blood is moving again. And his wife reaches for him again.\\n\\nThe formula is Aurivita Cayenne Pepper.\\n\\nThat plaque is building right now. In you. While you feel fine. While you think it's just age. While everyone you trust tells you it's normal. It's building, it's not stopping, and nobody is going to warn you.\\n\\nAurivita Cayenne Pepper. Link below.\\n\\nUp to 58% off for new customers, with a 120-day money-back guarantee. If nothing changes, you get every dollar back.\\n\\nYou don't have to overhaul your life first. You don't have to earn it. You don't have to prove sh*t to anyone.\\n\\nStop waiting for a system that makes money every time you refill that prescription to suddenly care about your blood flow.\\n\\nThey didn't care about Dave.\\n\\nThey don't care about you either.\\n\\nI'm sorry for swearing so much. But Dave's story really got to me. Look after yourselves.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"http://try.aurivita.co/pdp\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"try.aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"The Cayenne Fix Nobody Told Men About\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"\\\"My doctor put me on a statin when my LDL hit 184 — and the muscle aches were unbearable. My legs hurt going up the stairs. I stopped the statin and started Aurivita instead. Ten weeks later my LDL was 138, my HDL went up, and I walked nine holes of golf without my legs hurting once.\\\"\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":7146,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":64,\"duplicates\":7,\"reachDelta1d\":231,\"reachDelta7d\":6576,\"reachDelta30d\":6576},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],