TT\",\"TV\",\"TW\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VG\",\"VU\",\"WF\",\"WS\",\"YT\",\"ZA\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":4,\"currentRank\":4,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":66.67},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1023048506789785\",\"collationId\":\"2215282462608488\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-22T01:05:56.626Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-20T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-12T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":84,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/3708b40d8730304ce3dc3031b3a5684af0c4aea09b2f0eeeaeeed76751333264.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"999923659862342\",\"name\":\"Get Jacked\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/999923659862342.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"999923659862342\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":83140,\"totalReach\":1348637,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":506,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"If your energy is gone by noon, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf your legs feel heavy and your body feels older than it should, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf your circulation is sluggish, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf your stamina is not what it used to be, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf you feel winded doing things that never used to slow you down, take cayenne.\\n\\nIf you are over 40 and wake up already drained, take cayenne.\\n\\nThrow away the detox teas, energy drinks, and trendy supplements. Listen to me carefully.\\n\\nJust focus on getting real cayenne pepper in the right form.\\n\\nDrinking cayenne shots or sprinkling powder on food is not the same as taking concentrated cayenne softgels. Your stomach acid destroys most of it before it reaches your bloodstream.\\n\\nNow you might ask, why cayenne?\\n\\nBecause cayenne pepper activates something called the TRPV1 receptor. The 2021 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine was awarded for discovering this exact pathway. When TRPV1 is activated, your body releases nitric oxide, which relaxes blood vessels, improves circulation, and restores the steady energy your body is supposed to have. As you age, this pathway slows down. Cayenne wakes it back up.\\n\\nBut before you go buy any cayenne supplement, there is one thing you need to know. Most capsules hit your stomach, burn for ten minutes, and do nothing for your blood vessels. The delivery method matters. Oil-encapsulated softgels bypass the stomach acid and deliver 6 to 8 hours of sustained release directly where it counts.\\n\\nGetJacked delivers 3,000mg equivalent of cayenne per serving in oil-encapsulated softgels. Plus Korean Red Ginseng, Beetroot Powder, and BioPerine for maximum absorption. Nothing else.\\n\\n2,847 verified customers. 4.8 out of 5 stars. 120-day money-back guarantee. BOGO offer available today. Tap below while it is still in stock.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://get-jacked.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"get-jacked.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Support Your Circulation and Energy Every Day\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Get Jacked\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":6,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1090641853433498\",\"collationId\":\"1115895760793775\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-22T08:51:33.042Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-21T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-10-16T09:13:39.399Z\",\"daysRunn