{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XJVuwCDDLqbtXhn2o6LtMu","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"9198b90f-267a-4aa1-b843-07bc98272c2d\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_5537313523160308\",\"collationId\":\"1443877674242696\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-13T15:43:45.122Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-12T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-16T10:25:15.989Z\",\"daysRunning\":96,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/5bbf745e0c9a669bcaaa87ab81de6c58b30226660d1e8d11ce1b9ecb128d04e5.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/40ac87fa51282d19a5933df2f81e4b65ffdbc359ded1b53ec48cf5a9d808f2e8.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1214884455043031\",\"name\":\"The Blood Flow Journal\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1214884455043031.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1214884455043031\",\"liveAdsCount\":27,\"reach30d\":118863,\"totalReach\":546266,\"countriesCount\":142,\"facebookLikes\":842,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feeling cold, tired, or sluggish more often than you’d like?\\n\\nVitalia® Cayenne Pepper Softgels are made with cayenne pepper, beetroot, turmeric, ginseng, and grape seed extract — ingredients traditionally used to support circulation, cardiovascular health, and daily energy.\\n\\n✨ Supports healthy blood flow\\n✨ Helps maintain natural energy levels\\n✨ No jitters or crashes\\n\\nSimple daily support designed to help you feel more active and energised.\",\"transcript\":\"Day one of taking cayenne pepper soft gels for my diabetes. My toes have been numb for two years and my fasting glucose is sitting at 168. Hope this actually works. Day three. My fasting glucose this morning was 152. That's the lowest reading I've had since I was diagnosed. And my feet weren't ice cold when I woke up. First time in months. Day seven. Fasting glucose down to 141. The tingling in my toes that's been there for two years? It actually feels like a foot again. I can feel the bath mat under my feet for the first time since 2022. Day 14, 132 this morning. My afternoon crashes are gone. I haven't needed my 2 p.m. coffee in six days. My endocrinologist's office called to confirm my next appointment and I almost canceled because I feel that different. Day 21. Three full weeks. Fasting glucose 118. Numbness gone. Cold feet gone. Brain fog gone. I haven't felt this awake since before I was diagnosed. Thank God this stuff actually works. So my doctor told me that diabetes is actually a circulation disease, not a sugar disease. The high blood sugar is just the smoke. The real fire is your blood vessels stiffening and shutting down the circulation to your eyes, your kidneys, your feet, and your nerves. That's why he told me to stop relying on metformin alone. He said metformin only lowers the number on the meter, but it never reaches the small capillaries where the actual damage is happening. So the vessels keep closing, the nerves keep dying, and your A1C goes up the next year no matter what you do. Then he handed me these cayenne pepper soft gels instead and told me to take two every night before bed. He explained that cayenne contains a compound called capsaicine and it's the only thing that actually reaches the smallest capillaries diabetes is destroying. Once it gets there, it opens the vessels back up, rebuilds the nerves diabetes was killing, and helps your cells pull glucose out of your blood without needing extra insulin. So your circulation, your nerves, and your blood sugar all start fixing themselves at the same time. But he warned me that most cayenne supplements on Amazon are basically ground bell pepper dust with capsaicin levels below 0.1%, and that's way too weak to do anything for a diabetic body. He said you need a high Scoville cayenne stacked with the right absorption support, otherwise you're just swallowing pepper. So he gave me this specific brand, Vitalia Cayenne Pepper. He said it's the only one he trusts because it uses high Scoville cayenne stacked with beetroot for nitric oxide, Hawthorn berry for the heart, Panax ginseng for energy, black pepper to multiply absorption by five times, and D3 plus K2 to clear the calcium hardening your arteries, five compounds working at every level of your circulation, and every batch is third-party tested in America before it reaches a customer. He told me to give it three weeks and just watch what happens. So that's exactly what I did, and you just saw the results. Right now, Vitalia Cayenne Pepper is running buy two, get one free with free shipping, and a 30-day money-back guarantee. But they only release a limited batch each week and sell out every time a video like this gets posted. If the link below still works, grab it before they're gone.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia%C2%AE-cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Transform today\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":27349,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":246,\"duplicates\":11,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":560},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BL\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BT\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CN\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CW\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"DM\",\"DO\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FM\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GD\",\"GE\",\"GF\",\"GG\",\"GI\",\"GL\",\"GP\",\"GR\",\"GU\",\"GY\",\"HK\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"JP\",\"KG\",\"KH\",\"KI\",\"KM\",\"KN\",\"KR\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LC\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"MF\",\"MH\",\"MM\",\"MN\",\"MO\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MS\",\"MT\",\"MU\",\"MX\",\"MY\",\"NF\",\"NI\",\"NL\",\"NR\",\"NU\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PA\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PW\",\"PY\",\"QA\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"SA\",\"SB\",\"SC\",\"SE\",\"SH\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SR\",\"ST\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"SY\",\"TC\",\"TH\",\"TL\",\"TO\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TV\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VG\",\"VU\",\"WS\",\"YT\",\"ZA\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":33,\"currentRank\":33,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":76.74},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1946426860078206\",\"collationId\":\"1397333778420963\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-26T10:11:56.216Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-25T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-05T18:21:57.114Z\",\"daysRunning\":72,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/5a676b20faa99dd6e73a0b4c430e14226d37c01ae2b1fdc34df267ffa4f2bdd6.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/3a250257e00f6bf1868f117d88f2fe2756f3ba95016925e48c421a4ddb80b18f.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1214884455043031\",\"name\":\"The Blood Flow Journal\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1214884455043031.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1214884455043031\",\"liveAdsCount\":27,\"reach30d\":118863,\"totalReach\":546266,\"countriesCount\":36,\"facebookLikes\":842,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":null,\"transcript\":\"Watch what happens to this brother after taking Vitalia Cayenne soft gels every single day to fix his ED. Day one, nothing he could feel yet, but the capsaicin already went to work deep in his blood vessels. It flips on these switches called TRPV-1 receptors and floods his arteries with nitric oxide, opening up the pathways that have been choked off for years. Same pathway the blue pills use, except his body doing it on its own now. Day three, first sign hit him in the middle of the day. He caught himself half hard sitting on the couch. No reason, no thinking about it. Blood was pushing through to places it ain't reached in years. The beetroot in there keeping that nitric oxide flowing all day long so it ain't a quick spark that dies by noon. It stays. Day seven, brother woke up to morning wood for the first time in years. Rock solid. He just laid there like, what the hell? The turmeric been calming the inflammation that was corroding his vessel walls and choking the blood off before it could ever reach him. That night, his wife reached for him, and he responded like he used to. Day 14, now it wasn't just showing up, it was staying. That thing got hard and stayed hard the whole time. No more losing it halfway through and feeling that panic. The hawthorn been strengthening his circulation so the blood don't just show up, it holds. 100% firm, full size all the way through. Day 21, the drive came roaring back on top of it. He wanted her again. That hunger he thought was gone for good. The ginseng lit his energy and his desire back up. And the grapeseed been keeping his vessels clean and strong so this ain't a one-time fluke. It lasts. Sensitivity, back from tip to base. Brother confident again. And now he the one starting it. He fixed his ED at the root. No blue pills, no pump. Just two easy soft gels a day. Thousands of brothers with ED already seeing the same results. Get your Vitalia with a 30-day results or full refund guarantee. Link below. Go.\",\"callToAction\":\"SEE DETAILS\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia-cayenne-pepper-softgels-low-nitric-oxide\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":27219,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":245,\"duplicates\":9,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BG\",