ttle design to look like the real thing. She spent two months taking nothing, thinking Vitalia didn't work. The real Vitalia never made it to her door. Folks, when you get a product that actually does what it's supposed to do, the fakes come out of the woodwork. If the packaging doesn't look exactly like this, you're not getting the real stuff. So we redesigned the bag. New look, harder to copy, only available on our site. As always, do your own research. Talk to your doctor. Look into what cayenne and berberine actually do for blood sugar. It's a tiny, easy-to-swallow soft gel. Two a day, that's it. I take it to help my glucose. Simple as that. I'm getting up there in age, you know, and I'd rather take a supplement and stay off another prescription. That's me. You do your own thing. But make sure what you're holding is real. Compare your bag to the new design on the site. If it doesn't match, you've been scammed, and those 30, 60, 90 days you spent waiting for results, gone. You're not getting that time back. 80% off the new packaging right now. We're flooding the market before the copycats catch up. Click below. Get yours today. If it doesn't come from us, it's not Vitalia.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia%C2%AE-cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Feel Warmer, Lighter & More Energised\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":3059,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":28,\"duplicates\":8,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GR\",\"HR\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"LT\",\"LV\",\"NZ\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"RO\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":50},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1045825071696900\",\"collationId\":\"833457403130720\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-26T10:11:56.216Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-26T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-27T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/7b88c9ab6772a32650a88160ec9bd6c2053aac1e3b08651ba21d159d99e32075.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/f3335736b5bfe31e004bd1bdf620f59b5ce522e074d75075a1cabd254c51d7d9.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1214884455043031\",\"name\":\"The Blood Flow Journal\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1214884455043031.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1214884455043031\",\"liveAdsCount\":27,\"reach30d\":118863,\"totalReach\":546266,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":842,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Support your daily energy and vitality from the inside out.\\n\\nVitalia Cayenne Pepper Softgels are made with a plant-based formula designed to help support healthy circulation, vascular function, and overall wellness as part of your daily routine.\\n\\nHealthy blood flow plays an important role in how your body feels, moves, and performs throughout the day. \\n\\nThat’s why Vitalia is formulated to support:\\n✓ Healthy circulation\\n✓ Vascular wellness\\n✓ Nitric oxide support\\n✓ Daily energy and vitality\\nNo stimulants.\\nNo complicated routine.\\nJust simple daily support for men who want to feel their best.\\nAdd Vitalia® Cayenne Pepper Softgels to your wellness routine today.\\n\\nLimited stock available.\",\"transcript\":\"I am diabetes, and everything your doctor told you about me is a lie. The real damage I do, he's never even mentioned. The dry mouth, the fatigue, the tingling in your feet, the blurry vision. You think those are the problem. They're not. They're just me, waving at you. The real work I do is much quieter and much worse. Here's my secret. The one thing nobody ever tells you. The damage I do was never really about the sugar in your blood. It's about what I do to the roads that carry it. Your blood vessels. I spend years stiffening and narrowing the smallest ones. The tiny capillaries that feed your nerves, your eyes, your kidneys, and your feet. I choke them shut, one by one, until the blood can't get through. And a body part that can't get blood doesn't heal. It dies slowly. That is my real weapon. And then I send it to destroy. Your feet. I close the vessels feeding the nerves down to your toes until they starve and go silent. First the tingling. Then the burning. Then you lose them. Your eyes. I shut down the tiny vessels in your retina until they weaken and scar. Slowly, quietly, until one day you open your eyes and the world is gone. And mutformin? It lowers the sugar in your blood, but it never reaches the vessels I've already closed. So the circulation keeps collapsing while the meter says you're fine. Dieting? Go ahead. I'll wait. You can count every calorie you want. As long as the blood can't reach your nerves and your organs, I keep winning. No. I am Vitalia Cayenne Pepper. I was made to do the one thing metformin and dieting can't. I reopened the vessels that diabetes spent years closing. My capsaicin reaches the smallest capillaries, the exact ones it chokes shut, and forces them back open. Beetroot floods the system with nitric oxide to keep them wide. And not the cheap bell pepper dust kind your body can't even feel. High Scoville Cayenne. Strong enough to actually reach the damage. When the vessels reopen, the blood finally flows back to the nerves, the eyes, the kidneys, and the feet that diabetes left starving. Take that away from diabetes, and it loses its only weapon. I reopen the roads. The blood flows back. And diabetes loses its army. Don't wait for the damage to get worse. Get me by clicking below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/pages/7-reasons-switching-to-vitalia-cayenne-vstd-550\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Fix Blood, Fix Everything\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":8,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":30,\"currentRank\":30,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":31.91},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1810788073270647\",\"collationId\":\"1071227692430093\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-13T02:11:25.416Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-12T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-06T04:13:38.469Z\",\"daysRunning\":73,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/aaebc4a7accb3d90e3ed034b25214385b8e0c25c2c82020749aec51a86f637b9.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/b5829d1a13e6b04d4d1bc6a643834f7e9298b697dcbc0a294618e108f516f813.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1292250403962180\",\"name\":\"South Bay Diabetes Clinic\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1292250403962180.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1292250403962180\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":77272,\"totalReach\":725289,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":1112,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"👁️ Noticing more floaters lately?\\n\\n🚘 Or halos around headlights when you drive at night?\\n\\nMost people assume it's just their prescription getting weaker.\\n\\nBut the blood vessels feeding your retina are the smallest ones in your entire body, about the width of a single blood cell.\\n\\n⚠️ When circulation to those vessels gets restricted, the tissue behind your eyes runs short on oxygen.\\n\\nThat's where the blurriness and the floaters start.\\n\\n✅ Vitalia is built to support blood flow to exactly those small vessels.\\n\\n🌶️ High-potency cayenne, standardized for capsaicin, suspended in oil so it actually absorbs.\\n\\n💊 Two softgels every morning.\\n\\n 30-day money-back guarantee.\",\"transcript\":\"If a diabetic with early vision changes took two of these soft gels every morning, here's what would happen. In just a few minutes, the capsaicin from 30,000 cayenne peppers gets to work. It's activating TRPV1 receptors, pumping a rapid surge of nitric oxide into the smallest blood vessels in your body, the capillaries behind your eyes. This opens up the pathways that have been starved for years and lets fresh, oxygenated blood finally reach the retina. Then beetroot extract joins in, relaxing the vessel walls even further and pushing circulation deeper into tissue that's been running on fumes. Grapeseed extract reinforces the vessel structure itself, so the capillaries stay open instead of leaking and swelling the way damaged ones do. In just a few weeks, the floaters that have been drifting across your vision start to fade. The blurry patches that made reading a struggle start to clear, and night driving stops feeling like staring through fog. Meanwhile, turmeric and cinnamon prevent the blood sugar spikes that damage those vessels in the first place, so the improvement doesn't get undone at the next meal. And because it also has vitamins K2 and D3, it clears out the clogs sitting in those smaller vessels, so blood can actually reach the places it's been shut out of for years. By your next eye exam, the retinal specialist pulls up the scan and goes quiet for a second longer than usual. He can't quite believe what he's looking at. Thousands of people have already watched their vision keep slipping, but flipped it around with Vitalia. If you want to protect your vision naturally, grab your bag of Vitalia today.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/cayenne-softgels-copy\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Restore Healthy Vision & Blood Flow\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":10318,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":93,\"duplicates\":7,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":2231},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":171,\"currentRank\":171,\"rankDelta\":-165,\"improvementPct\":70.66},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2038983936751425\",\"collationId\":\"997210913403436\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-29T08:18:10.584Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-28T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-16T10:25:15.989Z\",\"daysRunning\":49,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6ce2330e1889ffd6cf8496f3cfb5443e446661eac96c0b0775ad434d10b27621.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/1c0186092fe9eb75fdc62395dd41e97b69931f2851ddad18cb11b9ca79d431e0.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1214884455043031\",\"name\":\"The Blood Flow Journal\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1214884455043031.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1214884455043031\",\"liveAdsCount\":27,\"reach30d\":118863,\"totalReach\":546266,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":842,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feeling the effects of getting older? Your circulation might need some support. 🩸\\nAs men age, healthy blood flow becomes harder to maintain — and it affects more than you might think. Energy, comfort, vitality, and ever