 dust. And capsaicin is fat soluble. In a dry capsule with no oil, your body flushes it before it ever reaches your blood vessels. Remember, if it's not a deep amber soft gel with oil built in, the capsaicin was never going to absorb. Third, the only way to guarantee you're getting real high potency capsaicin suspended in oil with six more herbs for the full circulation pathway, beetroot for nitric oxide, turmeric for inflammation, hawthorn for your heart, ginseng for energy, grapeseed extract for vessel protection and black pepper for absorption is to order directly from the link below. Every order ships straight from our own warehouse. Fast delivery right to your door. No third party sellers, no middlemen, no guesswork. When you buy directly from us, your order is fully guaranteed for 30 days. If you don't love it, we refund you 100%, no questions asked. Protect your health, avoid the fakes, and only order the real stuff by clicking the link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels-general-angle\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Low energy. Sluggish days. Feeling off?\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":10828,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":97,\"duplicates\":6,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":171},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":31,\"currentRank\":31,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":72.09},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2150857109180110\",\"collationId\":\"2549998008834391\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-11T09:50:26.652Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-10T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-22T14:23:01.282Z\",\"daysRunning\":73,\"