s your blood vessels stiffening and shutting down the circulation to your eyes, your kidneys, your feet, and your nerves. That's why he told me to stop relying on metformin alone. He said metformin only lowers the number on the meter, but it never reaches the small capillaries where the actual damage is happening. So the vessels keep closing, the nerves keep dying, and your A1C goes up the next year no matter what you do. Then he handed me these cayenne pepper soft gels instead and told me to take two every night before bed. He explained that cayenne contains a compound called capsaicine and it's the only thing that actually reaches the smallest capillaries diabetes is destroying. Once it gets there, it opens the vessels back up, rebuilds the nerves diabetes was killing, and helps your cells pull glucose out of your blood without needing extra insulin. So your circulation, your nerves, and your blood sugar all start fixing themselves at the same time. But he warned me that most cayenne supplements on Amazon are basically ground bell pepper dust with capsaicin levels below 0.1%, and that's way too weak to do anything for a diabetic body. He said you need a high Scoville cayenne stacked with the right absorption support, otherwise you're just swallowing pepper. So he gave me this specific brand, Vitalia Cayenne Pepper. He said it's the only one he trusts because it uses high Scoville cayenne stacked with beetroot for nitric oxide, Hawthorn berry for the heart, Panax ginseng for energy, black pepper to multiply absorption by five times, and D3 plus K2 to clear the calcium hardening your arteries, five compounds working at every level of your circulation, and every batch is third-party tested in America before it reaches a customer. He told me to give it three weeks and just watch what happens. So that's exactly what I did, and you just saw the results. Right now, Vitalia Cayenne Pepper is running buy two, get one free with free shipping, and a 30-day money-back guarantee. But they only release a limited batch each week and sell out every time a video like this gets posted. If the link below still works, grab it before they're gone.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia%C2%AE-cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Transform today\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":27349,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":246,\"duplicates\":11,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":560},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BL\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BT\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CN\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CW\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"DM\",\"DO\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FM\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GD\",\"GE\",\"GF\",\"GG\",\"GI\",\"GL\",\"GP\",\"GR\",\"GU\",\"GY\",\"HK\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"JP\",\"KG\",\"KH\",\"KI\",\"KM\",\"KN\",\"KR\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LC\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"MF\",\"MH\",\"MM\",\"MN\",\"MO\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MS\",\"MT\",\"MU\",\"MX\",\"MY\",\"NF\",\"NI\",\"NL\",\"NR\",\"NU\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PA\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PW\",\"PY\",\"QA\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"SA\",\"SB\",\"SC\",\"SE\",\"SH\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SR\",\"ST\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"SY\",\"TC\",\"TH\",\"TL\",\"TO\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TV\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VG\",\"VU\",\"WS\",\"YT\",\"ZA\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":33,\"currentRank\":33,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":76.74},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1946426860078206\",\"collationId\":\"1397333778420963\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\