rd and stayed hard the whole time. No more losing it halfway through and feeling that panic. The hawthorn been strengthening his circulation so the blood don't just show up, it holds. 100% firm, full size all the way through. Day 21, the drive came roaring back on top of it. He wanted her again. That hunger he thought was gone for good. The ginseng lit his energy and his desire back up. And the grapeseed been keeping his vessels clean and strong so this ain't a one-time fluke. It lasts. Sensitivity, back from tip to base. Brother confident again. And now he the one starting it. He fixed his ED at the root. No blue pills, no pump. Just two easy soft gels a day. Thousands of brothers with ED already seeing the same results. Get your Vitalia with a 30-day results or full refund guarantee. Link below. Go.\",\"callToAction\":\"SEE DETAILS\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia-cayenne-pepper-softgels-low-nitric-oxide\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":27219,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":245,\"duplicates\":9,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GG\",\"GI\",\"GR\",\"HR\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"MT\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"RO\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":3,\"currentRank\":3,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":1.27},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1048339688096635\",\"collationId\":\"2527666700989432\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-27T02:37:26.213Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-26T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-15T