stay off another prescription. That's me. You do your own thing. But make sure what you're holding is real. Compare your bag to the new design on the site. If it doesn't match, you've been scammed, and those 30, 60, 90 days you spent waiting for results, gone. You're not getting that time back. 80% off the new packaging right now. We're flooding the market before the copycats catch up. Click below. Get yours today. If it doesn't come from us, it's not Vitalia.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia%C2%AE-cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Feel Warmer, Lighter & More Energised\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":3059,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":28,\"duplicates\":8,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BG\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GR\",\"HR\",\"HU\",\"IE\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"LT\",\"LV\",\"NZ\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"RO\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":50},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1045825071696900\",\"collationId\":\"833457403130720\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-26T10:11:56.216Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-26T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-27T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/7b88c9ab6772a32650a88160ec9bd6c2053aac1e3b08651ba21d159d99e32075.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/f3335736b5bfe31e004bd1bdf620f59b5ce522e074d75075a1cabd254c51d7d9.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1214884455043031\",\"name\":\"