t. First the tingling. Then the burning. Then you lose them. Your eyes. I shut down the tiny vessels in your retina until they weaken and scar. Slowly, quietly, until one day you open your eyes and the world is gone. And mutformin? It lowers the sugar in your blood, but it never reaches the vessels I've already closed. So the circulation keeps collapsing while the meter says you're fine. Dieting? Go ahead. I'll wait. You can count every calorie you want. As long as the blood can't reach your nerves and your organs, I keep winning. No. I am Vitalia Cayenne Pepper. I was made to do the one thing metformin and dieting can't. I reopened the vessels that diabetes spent years closing. My capsaicin reaches the smallest capillaries, the exact ones it chokes shut, and forces them back open. Beetroot floods the system with nitric oxide to keep them wide. And not the cheap bell pepper dust kind your body can't even feel. High Scoville Cayenne. Strong enough to actually reach the damage. When the vessels reopen, the blood finally flows back to the nerves, the eyes, the kidneys, and the feet that diabetes left starving. Take that away from diabetes, and it loses its only weapon. I reopen the roads. The blood flows back. And diabetes loses its army. Don't wait for the damage to get worse. Get me by clicking below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/pages/7-reasons-switching-to-vitalia-cayenne-vstd-550\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Fix Blood, Fix Everything\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":8,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":30,\"currentRank\":30,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":31.91},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isM