lood vessels in your body, the capillaries behind your eyes. This opens up the pathways that have been starved for years and lets fresh, oxygenated blood finally reach the retina. Then beetroot extract joins in, relaxing the vessel walls even further and pushing circulation deeper into tissue that's been running on fumes. Grapeseed extract reinforces the vessel structure itself, so the capillaries stay open instead of leaking and swelling the way damaged ones do. In just a few weeks, the floaters that have been drifting across your vision start to fade. The blurry patches that made reading a struggle start to clear, and night driving stops feeling like staring through fog. Meanwhile, turmeric and cinnamon prevent the blood sugar spikes that damage those vessels in the first place, so the improvement doesn't get undone at the next meal. And because it also has vitamins K2 and D3, it clears out the clogs sitting in those smaller vessels, so blood can actually reach the places it's been shut out of for years. By your next eye exam, the retinal specialist pulls up the scan and goes quiet for a second longer than usual. He can't quite believe what he's looking at. Thousands of people have already watched their vision keep slipping, but flipped it around with Vitalia. If you want to protect your vision naturally, grab your bag of Vitalia today.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/cayenne-softgels-copy\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Restore Healthy Vision & Blood Flow\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":10318,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":93,\"duplicates\":7,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":2231},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":171,\"currentRank\":171,\"rankDelta\":-165,\"improvementPct\":70.66},\