. When you buy directly from us, your order is fully guaranteed for 30 days. If you don't love it, we refund you 100%, no questions asked. Protect your health, avoid the fakes, and only order the real stuff by clicking the link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels-general-angle\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Low energy. Sluggish days. Feeling off?\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":10828,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":97,\"duplicates\":6,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":171},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":31,\"currentRank\":31,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":72.09},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2150857109180110\",\"collationId\":\"2549998008834391\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-11T09:50:26.652Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-10T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-22T14:23:01.282Z\",\"daysRunning\":73,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/ab9b154fba48c019bbc2ed890f74f8c72954ea0a896b1b105bc87bbd2f15485d.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/141059645633bb593f536809ee523b399c282d52f9fe1a8c1f8bb53d73ab5db1.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1214884455043031\",\"name\":\"The Blood Flow Journal\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1214884455043031.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1214884455043031\",\"liveAdsCount\":27,\"reach30d\":118863,\"totalReach\":546266,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":842,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feeling the effects of getting older? Your circulation mi