 hard sitting on the couch. No reason, no thinking about it. Blood was pushing through to places it ain't reached in years. The beetroot in there keeping that nitric oxide flowing all day long so it ain't a quick spark that dies by noon. It stays. Day seven, brother woke up to morning wood for the first time in years. Rock solid. He just laid there like, what the hell? The turmeric been calming the inflammation that was corroding his vessel walls and choking the blood off before it could ever reach him. That night, his wife reached for him, and he responded like he used to. Day 14, now it wasn't just showing up, it was staying. That thing got hard and stayed hard the whole time. No more losing it halfway through and feeling that panic. The hawthorn been strengthening his circulation so the blood don't just show up, it holds. 100% firm, full size all the way through. Day 21, the drive came roaring back on top of it. He wanted her again. That hunger he thought was gone for good. The ginseng lit his energy and his desire back up. And the grapeseed been keeping his vessels clean and strong so this ain't a one-time fluke. It lasts. Sensitivity, back from tip to base. Brother confident again. And now he the one starting it. He fixed his ED at the root. No blue pills, no pump. Just two easy soft gels a day. Thousands of brothers with ED already seeing the same results. Get your Vitalia with a 30-day results or full refund guarantee. Link below. Go.","callToAction":"SEE DETAILS","landingPageUrl":"https://shopvitalia.co/products/vitalia-cayenne-pepper-softgels-low-nitric-oxide","landingPageDomain":"shopvitalia.co","ctaDescription":null,"ctaLinkDescription":null},"metrics":{"reach":27219,"aggregatedReach":null,"estimatedSpend":245,"duplicates":9,"reachDelta1d":null,"reachDelta7d":null,"reachDelta30d":0},"audience":{"targetedCountries":["AT","AU","BE","BG","CA","CZ","DE","DK","EE","ES","FI","FO","FR","GB","GG","GI","GR","HR","HU","IE","IM","IT","JE","LT","LU","LV","MT","NL","N