, grab your pack of Aura Vida today. Click below to get yours.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/products/capsaicin-power-diabetes\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Finally Take Control of Your Diabetes — Naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":270515,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2435,\"duplicates\":43,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":2,\"reachDelta30d\":565},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":5,\"currentRank\":5,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":10.42},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1609183340182548\",\"collationId\":\"3850897845040199\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-26T01:10:14.850Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-25T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-07-25T12:27:40.928Z\",\"daysRunning\":183,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/045734fb7d757b06696be83c16919459f3ab1e77edba04285710390e89aa4034.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/e3b0d6585190d0d2bd3a53643b1451089c306ff7957e8d233170af1aa7c40cf6.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1034637323059826\",\"name\":\"Aurivita\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1034637323059826.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1034637323059826\",\"liveAdsCount\":414,\"reach30d\":95082,\"totalReach\":1509568,\"countriesCount\":6,\"facebookLikes\":1697,\"instagramFollowers\":1636},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Aurivita Capsaicin Power is 50% off today.\\n\\nThe natural circulation support over 47,000 men have already chosen.\