utomatic. Your A1C is the lowest it's been in years. The cold hands, the numbness, the crashes, the brain fog, gone. Your body is managing blood sugar the way it was always supposed to. You didn't just manage your diabetes. You took back control of it. If you want to go through this transformation yourself with Aura Vida, click below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Are You Diabetic and Tired of Just Managing It? 🩸\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":257418,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2317,\"duplicates\":57,\"reachDelta1d\":749,\"reachDelta7d\":2995,\"reachDelta30d\":22274},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"US\",\"VI\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":17,\"currentRank\":17,\"rankDelta\":-2,\"improvementPct\":3.21},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1023741333591479\",\"collationId\":\"2174100299858472\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-31T06:43:12.262Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-07-30T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-04T03:31:48.756Z\",\"daysRunning\":117,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6b2e7ba2e3adeb76faf8076500b44f8a50d6b02c937b6d72db591692c04eaadf.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/e47cb86e4ed06f1ddfc4d4bddda15145b2d1b611264a0801953da7c8f9111d57.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1096958866837703\",\"name\":\"Life With Diabetes\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1096958866837703.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1096958866837703\",\"liveAdsCount\":31,\"reach30d\":427,\"totalReach\":1087978,\"countriesCount\":29,\"facebookLikes\":948,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Experience the Power of Aurivita Capsaicin Power!\\n\\n ✅ Supports healthy blood sugar response\\n ✅ Helps ease diabetic numbness, burning feet, and cold hands\\n ✅ Activates natural nitric oxide for better circulation\\n ✅ Pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin\\n ✅ 3mg therapeutic dose per serving\\n ✅ BioPerine for 2000% absorption\\n ✅ Plus Berberine, Cinnamon, D3 & K2\\n\\nStop fighting your blood sugar with pills that only manage the symptoms. Aurivita is formulated with seven science-backed ingredients that work together to rebuild your circulation and bring your numbers down at the root — backed by a 120-Day Risk-Free Guarantee.\",\"transcript\":\"If a diabetic with out-of-control blood sugar took three of these soft gels every morning, here's what would happen. In just a few minutes, the capsaicin from 30,000 cayenne peppers gets to work. It's activating TRPV1 receptors, pumping a rapid surge of nitric oxide in your arteries. This opens up the pathways and spreads warmth back into the fingers and toes that have been numb and cold for years. Then beetroot extract joins in, melting the stiffness in your vessel and improves circulation so the damaged nerves get fresh oxygen they need to start healing. In just one week, the burning in your feet quiets down, the tingling in your fingers fades, and the 3 a.m. bathroom trips that have been wrecking your sleep finally stop. Meanwhile, berberine, known for being a natural metformin, rips those glucose out of your bloodstream and shoves it into the cells where it belongs, so your high blood sugar starts dropping on its own. At the same time, cinnamon and turmeric kick in, preventing sugar spikes after every meal, so you can finally eat any food you want without being anxious that the numbers go up. In just a few weeks, not only does your A1C go down, but your vision gets clearer, your feet feel warmer, and your energy during the day gets better. And because it also has the vitamins K2 and D3, it clears out all the sugar clogs and blockages so the insulin hormone can finally pass through. By your next blood work, your A1C has already fallen a full point. Your doctor stares at the chart and looks surprised. He can't believe this would be possible. Thousands of diabetics have already watched their blood sugar stay high, but flipped it all around with AuraVita. If you want to lower your blood sugar naturally, grab your pack of AuraVita today. Click below to get yours.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/products/capsaicin-power-diabetes\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Finally Take Control of Your Diabetes — Naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":248008,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2232,\"duplicates\":39,\"reachDelta1d\":35,\"reachDelta7d\":144,\"reachDelta30d\":144},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BL\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":1,\"improvementPct\":6.45},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_4510427085838039\",\"collationId\":\"4712455925746672\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T01:37:35.377Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-05T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T17:33:12.032Z\",\"daysRunning\":50,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/f057069ee60066fbd6b0d3438817bb9b83464fffff89b9242ab97283333bdc8d.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/8204dd1a669ba5d9500c9724df2555cd95d81f0f4bca926a66c98068185fe2c1.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"100273425745335\",\"name\":\"Health Discoveries\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/100273425745335.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"100273425745335\",\"liveAdsCount\":237,\"reach30d\":330584,\"totalReach\":1139079,\"countriesCount\":28,\"facebookLikes\":5197,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Told you'd need a penile implant. Viagra stopped working. Sleeping in the guest room. Wife stopped initiating.\\n\\nMost doctors call this permanent.\\n\\nHere's what nobody tells you: your erection isn't broken because of diabetes. It's broken because your penile vessels are unprotected. High blood sugar burns through your body's ability to produce nitric oxide faster than you can replace it. Without nitric oxide, the vessels have no way to open. That's why diabetic ED fails Viagra.\\n\\nAurivita Capsaicin Power addresses the root. Pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin oil-suspended in cold-pressed avocado oil. K2 and D3 to break the calcium clogging diabetic vessels. BioPerine for absorption. Third-party tested. Made in the USA.\\n\\nMen are reporting:\\n🔸 Morning responses back within two weeks\\n🔸 Staying hard through by week four\\n🔸 Blood flow tests doubling by week eight\\n🔸 Specialists asking what changed\\n\\n🛡️ 120-day money-back guarantee.\\n🟠 50% off while the sale's on. Tap below.\",\"transcript\":\"Type two diabetes ruining your sex life? No morning wood? Going soft midway? Wife stopped initiating? That's diabetic ED, and there's a fix. One of my patients came to me two months ago after his urologist told him he'd need a penile implant within six months. Last week, that same specialist called me. He said his blood flow tests look healthier than they have in years. Here's what changed. When he first walked into my office, his life had already fallen apart. He hadn't been hard for his wife in two years. No morning would, no spontaneous arousal. The Viagra his doctor kept upping had stopped working around month eight. His wife had stopped initiating because she was tired of watching him fail. He'd started sleeping in the guest room to hide the shame. He'd handed his marriage over to a broken diabetic body and told his wife he was done. Then came the diagnosis that terrified him: severe diabetic erectile dysfunction. His doctor said it like it was nothing special. Your penile vessels are damaged from years of high blood sugar. It's gonna get worse. There's no cure. He wanted to inject his penis with trimix before every attempt, a $150 a shot, scarring and priapism risk. Said it might give him back some function. Might. Not fix and not reverse, just fake an erection for the rest of his life. He left that office feeling like his life was over. His wife brought him to me, and I told him something no doctor in that system ever had. Your erection is not just broken because of diabetes. It's broken because your penile vessels are unprotected. Your penile vessels are supposed to be opened by a compound called nitric oxide. High blood sugar burns through your body's ability to produce it faster than you can replace it. And without nitric oxide, your penile vessels have no way to open. That's why diabetic ED fails Viagra. That's why the pills work less every month no matter how much you take. Your erection isn't broken. The vessels feeding it are shut on a level the pills were never designed to reach. But here's what they don't tell you. You can restart that nitric oxide production. I put him on OraVita. It has pharmaceutical grade capsaicin oil suspended in cold pressed avocado oil, not the cheap ground cayenne dust from drugstore brands. Real doses, research backed amounts, plus vitamin K2 and D3 to break the calcium deposits clogging the diabetic vessels, and Bio Purine so it actually reaches the bloodstream instead of dying in your stomach. Three softgels every morning with his coffee. That's it. No penile injections. No $20,000 implant. No permanent risk. Just the complete circulation that his diabetic penile vessels had been starving for. Within two weeks, something shifted. He noticed morning wood for the first time in two years. That constant softness he'd gotten used to started lifting. By week four, he was staying hard through sex for the first time in years like a switch he didn't know was off had turned back on. Week six he called my office. He'd gone three rounds with his wife the night before, no Viagra, hardness from arousal alone. He was crying on the phone. And last week, exactly two months after starting, he went back to that same urology specialist. He ran the tests, stopped, looked at him, ran them again. This doesn't make sense, he said. His penile blood flow had doubled and his vessel elasticity looked stronger than it had in years. Then he ran the erectile function score. He scored in the range of a healthy 40 year old. He called me that afternoon, asked what I'd done. I told him about the capsaicin, the K2, the D3, about OraVita. He wrote it down. Two months from needing an implant for the rest of your life to hard for your wife. Without a pill, he made love to his wife three times first time in two years. I don't care what they diagnosed you with diabetic ED, low T, aging, or nothing works anymore. Your penile vessels are starving for nitric oxide, and every day without it, the damage gets worse. OraVita has a hundred and twenty day guarantee. If you don't wake up with morning wood, stay hard through sex, and feel like yourself again, you get every penny back, no questions. You've got nothing to lose except that shame. Click below, give your body what it's been begging for. Maybe in two months, you'll be the one whose specialist runs the scan twice. I'll see you on the other side. Tap below.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/collections/ed\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Diabetic and told you need a penile implant? Read this first.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":222992,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2007,\"duplicates\":14,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":54242},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":2,\"improvementPct\":0.42},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_29348355448104738\",\"collationId\":\"4532615467008399\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T18:02:17.195Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-19T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T13:35:26.755Z\",\"daysRunning\":36,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/4c9c0fc867d52830fcd34f8229ba25032a13ffd60a112514a68c8d316d5be033.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1229441906928393\",\"name\":\"Greg From Aurivita\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/1229441906928393.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1229441906928393\",\"liveAdsCount\":189,\"reach30d\":42962,\"totalReach\":449125,\"countriesCount\":28,\"facebookLikes\":6101,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"IMPORTANT: Aurivita Delivery Truck Overturns on I-40 — We Cannot Guarantee Stock Past This Week\\n\\nAt 6:14 AM this morning we got a call no brand ever wants to get.\\n\\nOne of our delivery trucks carrying our Cayenne Pepper Softgels lost control on I-40 outside of Winston-Salem.\\n\\nThe driver is okay.\\n\\nThe truck is not.\\n\\nOver 14,000 bags of product are now scattered across four lanes of highway.\\n\\nIf you've seen the photos circulating online, yes — those red bags on the asphalt are ours.\\n\\nThat shipment was supposed to keep us stocked through the end of November.\\n\\nIt won't be keeping anyone stocked now.\\n\\nWe want to be completely transparent with you because that's how we've always operated.\\n\\nOur Cayenne Pepper Softgels contain 3mg of capsaicin per serving dissolved in cold-pressed avocado oil with BioPerine, K2, and D3.\\n\\nIt's not something we can just reorder from a warehouse overnight.\\n\\nSourcing high-potency capsaicin extract at the concentration we use takes time.\\n\\nThen formulation. Then third-party testing. Then encapsulation.\\n\\nFrom raw ingredient to finished softgel, we're looking at a minimum 6-week turnaround to replace what we lost this morning.\\n\\nWe've already contacted our manufacturer about expediting a new batch.\\n\\nBut expedited production costs us significantly more than our normal cycle.\\n\\nWhich means we cannot hold our current price once existing warehouse stock sells through.\\n\\nRight now we still have inventory in our facility.\\n\\nBut we have no idea how long it will last.\\n\\nWe were already selling at a pace that had us restocking every 3 weeks.\\n\\nLosing 14,000 bags just cut our runway in half.\\n\\nWe are not raising the price today.\\n\\nBut we cannot guarantee that the price stays the same next week.\\n\\nAnd we definitely cannot guarantee we won't sell out before the new batch arrives.\\n\\nIf you've been taking our Cayenne Pepper Softgels and you're thinking about reordering — do it now.\\n\\nIf you've been on the fence and waiting for the right time — this is it.\\n\\nWe'd rather you hear this from us directly than find out when you go to reorder and see a higher price or an out-of-stock page.\\n\\nEvery bag currently in our warehouse is available at today's price while it lasts.\\n\\nOnce it's gone, it's gone until the new batch clears testing.\\n\\nWe're sorry about this. It's not the update we wanted to send today.\\n\\nBut we promised we'd always be straight with you, and that means telling you when things go wrong — not just when things go right.\\n\\nCurrent pricing. Current stock. No guarantees on either past this week.\\n\\n— Greg from Aurivita\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/products/aurivita-capsaicin-power-1\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Aurivita Delivery Truck Overturns on I-40\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Support your cardiovascular health with our capsaicin softgels, a premium supplement meticulously formulated for those who prioritize long-term heart vitality.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":219075,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":1972,\"duplicates\":7,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":186,\"reachDelta30d\":899},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BL\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"IT\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":32,\"currentRank\":32,\"rankDelta\":-2,\"improvementPct\":16.93},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1723605608939156\",\"collationId\":\"1629976525195445\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-24T17:26:44.852Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-23T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-22T19:04:21.495Z\",\"daysRunning\":62,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/da032e190da0b871a59bbb5dc23bf50481583616dbed6383ce91b44cd27cc9cf.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/cdbbf99edd2b032486aabc01a2ba03c4b51c2888986b61e541b3b9d248bca33c.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"874702302401705\",\"name\":\"Men's Vitality\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/874702302401705.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"874702302401705\",\"liveAdsCount\":589,\"reach30d\":489826,\"totalReach\":1790791,\"countriesCount\":6,\"facebookLikes\":1952,\"instagramFollowers\":89},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Failed intimate moments. Blaming yourself. Popping blue pills that never quite work.\\n\\nMost diabetic men think this is just what's happening now.\\n\\nHere's what nobody tells you: the artery feeding your performance is one of the smallest in your body. Years of high blood sugar scarred it, narrowed it, made it stiff. The blue pill forces blood through a damaged vessel for an hour then quits. It isn't fixing the vessel.\\n\\nAurivita Capsaicin Power addresses the root. Slow-extracted capsaicin wakes the scarred vessels and forces them wide open. Beetroot opens circulation even wider. Korean Red Ginseng breaks loose the drive diabetes buried. Berberine drops the sugar that scarred the vessels in the first place. BioPerine ensures your diabetic gut absorbs every last bit.\\n\\nMen are reporting:\\n🔸 Mornings back within two weeks — like the old days\\n🔸 Wives looking at them different by day 30\\n🔸 No needles, no clinic, no blue pill workarounds\\n🔸 Blood flow back where diabetes cut it off\\n\\n🛡️ 120-day money-back guarantee.\\n🟠 50% off while the sale's on. Tap below.\",\"transcript\":\"Yo, it's your dick speaking. Stop popping blue pills and blaming me. You're diabetic. Let me tell you what's actually going on down here. I've been trying to tell you the plumbing is failing and you out here acting like everything's cool. You keep blaming me for not showing up, but have you ever once asked what I need? Nah, you just get mad, pop a blue pill and pray to God it works. And here's what nobody told you, brah. Those pills were never going to work for you the way they work for other men. That artery feeding me is one of the smallest in your whole body and years of high blood sugar scarred it up, narrowed it, made it stiff. A blue pill just forces blood through a damaged vessel for an hour, then quits. It ain't fixing the vessel. That's why you keep getting let down. So let me tell you exactly what I actually need. First, capsaicin. This is the big one. My supply line is scarred and barely letting a trickle through. Capsaicin wakes the vessel wall and forces these scarred vessels wide open. So blood actually gets down here again. Second, beetroot. Opens your circulation even wider and floods with the nitric oxide that keeps those vessels wide open long after capsaicin cracks them awake. Third, Korean red ginseng. Remember when I woke you up every single morning ready to go? That was your drive. Diabetes buried it under stress and ginseng breaks it loose. Fourth, berberine. Ginseng frees up what's already there. Berberine goes to the source and drops the blood sugar that scarred me up so nothing damages me again. Fifth, bioperine. Because diabetic gut could take all four of those and still lose most of it before it reaches me. Bioperine makes sure you absorb all so nothing is wasted. That's five. That's what I've been asking for this whole time. You could run around buying five different bottles and forget to take half of them like you forget everything else. Or you could just get Aura Vida. All five in one soft gel, three soft gels a day and I'm fed. Give me two weeks and I'll start waking you up in the morning again like the old days. Give me 30 days and your wife gonna be looking at you different. Five ingredients, one mission. Getting blood flow back where diabetes cut it off. 100% natural. No needles, no clinic, no blue pills with side effects down here if you know what I mean. I know you've been burned before. That's why there's a money back guarantee. Worst case you take every last capsule and they pay you back anyway. Best case you join tens of thousands of men who got their blood flow back and started waking up hard again. Come on man, links below. Do this for us. We used to be a good team. Let's get back to it.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/pages/adv-general-ed-listicle\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"You're diabetic. Here's what's happening down there.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Join 150,000+ Happy Customers!\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":211244,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":1901,\"duplicates\":28,\"reachDelta1d\":82,\"reachDelta7d\":2852,\"reachDelta30d\":50778},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":3,\"currentRank\":3,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":0.51},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":8,\"total\":87990,\"totalPages\":1250,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":true},\"meta\":{\"query\":\"capsaicin\",\"keywords\":[],\"searchIn\":\"ad_copy\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"reach\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":8,\"effectiveLimit\":8,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"all\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\":null,\"adReachGrowth\":null,\"language\":null,\"adLanguages\":[],\"cta\":[],\"currency\":null,\"currencies\":[],\"shopifyAppIds\":[],\"excludeShopifyAppIds\":[],\"pixelIds\":[],\"excludePixelIds\":[],\"themeIds\":[],\"filters\":{\"search\":[\"capsaicin\"],\"searchType\":\"adCopy\",\"keywordMode\":\"any\",\"sortBy\":\"reach\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"page\":1,\"limit\":8,\"platforms\":[\"facebook\"],\"status\":\"all\",\"adLanguage\":[\"en\"],\"maxAdsPerBrand\":1},\"warnings\":[\"Reported total remains exact, but totalPages is capped by pageable depth (offset<=10000).\"],\"paginationMaxOffset\":10000},\"fieldGuide\":{\"countryBreakdowns\":[{\"path\":\"data[].audience.targetedCountries\",\"meaning\":\"Full ad targeting country list, including non-EU markets such as US.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].audience.mainCountry\",\"meaning\":\"Primary audience country from Meta's EU/UK ad transparency data; null for ads outside that scope, even when the ad targets those markets.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].advertiser.countriesCount\",\"meaning\":\"Number of advertiser countries detected; not a country split.\"}],\"richNestedData\":[{\"path\":\"data[].collationId\",\"meaning\":\"Identifier of the combined creative represented by this search result. Pass it as scan_ad.collation_id to scan the same aggregate instead of only the representative ad.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].advertiser\",\"meaning\":\"Facebook page identity, reach, followers, and live ads.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].content\",\"meaning\":\"Ad copy, transcript fallback, CTA, and landing page.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].media\",\"meaning\":\"Media type, thumbnails, and media URLs.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].metrics\",\"meaning\":\"Reach, spend estimate, deltas, and duplicate metrics.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].audience\",\"meaning\":\"Country, gender, and age targeting fields.\"},{\"path\":\"data[].flags\",\"meaning\":\"EU, low-reach, media-changed, and partner-badge flags.\"}]},\"credits\":{\"requestedUnits\":8,\"effectiveUnits\":8,\"actualUnits\":8,\"costUnits\":12,\"recurringUnits\":12,\"topupUnits\":0,\"creditsRemaining\":2557,\"creditsSourceHeader\":\"recurring\",\"failurePhase\":null,\"releaseAttempted\":false,\"releaseSucceeded\":null}}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c80ac761-4344-4193-8afa-0134bff4b938","uuid":"fd4c39b7-bacb-4ef2-8cb2-17e4104f37ce","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:45:23.286Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"requestId\":\"c9294b6a-fbe7-4bd5-b690-9a01ce2df0d8\",\"data\