ogs and blockages so the insulin hormone can finally pass through. By your next blood work, your A1C has already fallen a full point. Your doctor stares at the chart and looks surprised. He can't believe this would be possible. Thousands of diabetics have already watched their blood sugar stay high, but flipped it all around with AuraVita. If you want to lower your blood sugar naturally, grab your pack of AuraVita today. Click below to get yours.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/products/capsaicin-power-diabetes\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Finally Take Control of Your Diabetes — Naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":248008,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":2232,\"duplicates\":39,\"reachDelta1d\":35,\"reachDelta7d\":144,\"reachDelta30d\":144},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BL\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":1,\"improvementPct\":6.45},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_4510427085838039\",\"collationId\":\"4712455925746672\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T01:37:35.377Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-05T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T17:33:12.032Z\",\"daysRunning\":50,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/f057069ee60066fbd6b0d3438817bb9b83464fffff89b9242ab97283333bdc8d.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/8204dd1a669ba5d9500c9724df2555cd95d81f0f4bca926a66c98068185fe2c1.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"100273425745335\",\"name\":\"Health Discoveries\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/100273425745335.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"100273425745335\",\"liveAdsCount\":237,\"reach30d\":330584,\"totalReach\":1139079,\"countriesCount\":28,\"facebookLikes\":5197,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Told you'd need a penile implant. Viagra stopped working. Sleeping in the guest room. Wife stopped initiating.\\n\\nMost doctors call this permanent.\\n\\nHere's what nobody tells you: your erection isn't broken because of diabetes. It's broken because your penile vessels are unprotected. High blood sugar burns through your body's ability to produce nitric oxide faster than you can replace it. Without nitric oxide, the vessels have no way to open. That's why diabetic ED fails Viagra.\\n\\nAurivita Capsaicin Power addresses the root. Pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin oil-suspended in cold-pressed avocado oil. K2 and D3 to break the calcium clogging diabetic vessels. BioPerine for absorption. Third-party tested. Made in the USA.\\n\\nMen are reporting:\\n🔸 Morning responses back within two weeks\\n🔸 Staying hard through by week four\\n🔸 Blood flow tests doubling by week eight\\n🔸 Specialists asking what changed\\n\\n🛡️ 120-day money-back guarantee.\\n🟠 50% off while the sale's on. Tap below.\",\"transcript\":\"Type two diabetes ruining your sex life? No morning wood? Going soft midway? Wife stopped initiating? That's diabetic ED, and there's a fix. One of my patients came to me two months ago after his urologist told him he'd need a penile implant within six months. Last week, that same specialist called me. He said his blood flow tests look healthier than they have in years. Here's what changed. When he first walked into my office, his life had already fallen apart. He hadn't been hard for his wife in two years. No morning would, no spontaneous arousal. The Viagra his doctor kept upping had stopped working around month eight. His wife had stopped initiating because she was tired of watching him fail. He'd started sleeping in the guest room to hide the shame. He'd handed his marriage over to a broken diabetic body and told his wife he was done. Then came the diagnosis that terrified him: severe diabetic erectile dysfunction. His doctor said it like it was nothing special. Your penile vessels are damaged from years of high blood sugar. It's gonna get worse. There's no cure. He wanted to inject his penis with trimix before every attempt, a $150 a shot, scarring and priapism risk. Said it might give him back some function. Might. Not fix and not reverse, just fake an erection for the rest of his life. He left that office feeling like his life was over. His wife brought him to me, and I told him something no doctor in that system ever had. Your erection is not just broken because of diabetes. It's broken because your penile vessels are unprotected. Your penile vessels are supposed to be opened by a compound called nitric oxide. High blood sugar burns through your body's ability to produce it faster than you can replace it. And without nitric oxide, your penile vessels have no way to open. That's why diabetic ED fails Viagra. That's why the pills work less every month no matter how much you take. Your erection isn't broken. The vessels feeding it are shut on a level the pills were never designed to reach. But here's what they don't tell you. You can restart that nitric oxide production. I put him on OraVita. It has pharmaceutical grade capsaicin oil suspended in cold pressed avocado oil, not the cheap ground cayenne dust from drugstore brands. Real doses, research backed amounts, plus vitamin K2 and D3 to break the calcium deposits clogging the diabetic vessels, and Bio Purine so it actually reaches the bloodstream instead of dying in your stomach. Three softgels every morning with his coffee. That's it. No penile injections. No $20,000 implant. No permanent risk. Just the complete circulation that his diabetic penile vessels had been starving for. Within two weeks, something shifted. He noticed morning wood for the first time in two years. That constant softness he'd gotten used to started lifting. By week four, he was staying hard through sex for the first time in years like a switch he didn't know was off had turned back on. Week six he called my office. He'd gone three rounds with his wife the night before, no Viagra, hardness from arousal alone. He was crying on the phone. And last week, exactly two months after starting, he went back to that same urology specialist. He ran the tests, stopped, looked at him, ran them again. This doesn't make sense, he said. His penile blood flow had doubled and his vessel elasticity looked stronger than it had in years. Then he ran the erectile function score. He scored in the range of a healthy 40 year old. He called me that afternoon, asked what I'd done. I told him about the capsaicin, the K2, the D3, about OraVita. He wrote it down. Two months from needing an implant for the rest of your life to hard for your wife. Without a pill, he made love to his wife three times first time in two years. I don't care what they diagnosed you with diabetic ED, low T, aging, or nothing works anymore. Your penile vessels are starving for nitric oxide, and every day without it, the damage gets worse. OraVita has a hundred and twenty day guarantee. If you don't wake up with morning wood, stay hard through sex, and feel like yourself again, you get every penny back, no questions. You've got nothing to lose except that shame. Click below, give your body what it's been begging for. Maybe in two months, you'll be the one whose specialist runs the scan twice. I'll see you on the other side. Tap below.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/collections/ed\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Diabetic and told you need a penile implant? Read this first.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":22299