in fancier packaging. Scam. And ground cayenne from the grocery store? Better than nothing, but barely 0.1% active capsaicin. Capsaicin multiplies by up to 10 times when 30,000 cayenne peppers are slow extracted at low temperatures and suspended in oil. That's the only way it reaches your bloodstream. Oravita is the real thing. Slow extracted cayenne in three odorless soft gels suspended in cold pressed avocado oil. Made in the USA, third party tested. Oravita is 50% off right now with a 120 day money back guarantee. If your ejaculation doesn't return, you pay nothing. If the button is still there, grab it before the sale ends.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/collections/bph\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"It's not age. Your pipes are just closing\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":14871,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":134,\"duplicates\":7,\"reachDelta1d\":903,\"reachDelta7d\":6628,\"reachDelta30d\":14860},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":7,\"currentRank\":7,\"rankDelta\":2,\"improvementPct\":1.43},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1159650033680867\",\"collationId\":\"2226536271601328\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-16T07:09:28.023Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-15T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-24T12:27:32.566Z\",\"daysRunning\":9,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/8628511dda3991630981747f5b23ff254bd48be54511fe96b330739984fde181.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"698499393345194\",\"name\":\"Could This End Your Sciatica Pain?\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/698499393345194.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"698499393345194\",\"liveAdsCount\":361,\"reach30d\":102415,\"totalReach\":2571709,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":3681,\"instagramFollowers\":15},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"MEN DON'T LOSE THEIR ERECTIONS TO F*CKING \\\"AGE.\\\" They don't lose them to stress. They don't even lose them to low testosterone.\\n\\nThey lose them to something that's been building inside their arteries since their twenties, and almost nobody in this country ever takes the time to tell them about it.\\n\\nI know because it happened to me. And when I finally understood what was going on, I couldn't believe nobody had said a word.\\n\\nDave was 54. He had a \\\"small problem.\\\"\\n\\nThat's it. A small problem. He was fine. Completely fine. Working. Golfing. Living his life.\\n\\nIt just took a little longer than it used to. Didn't always last.\\n\\nTwo years later, his wife is sleeping on the far edge of the bed and he's sitting on the couch at midnight googling things he deletes before morning.\\n\\nTWO YEARS.\\n\\nFrom \\\"it's nothing\\\" to a marriage where nobody touches anybody anymore.\\n\\nAnd nobody told him a thing. Because how do you explain that the system he trusted watched this build inside his arteries for 30 years and just handed him a pill?\\n\\nBecause that's what happens.\\n\\nOver and over and over. Millions of men. And I know EXACTLY what was building inside Dave while every doctor he saw told him it was \\\"normal at his age.\\\"\\n\\nHere's what was actually happening while he felt perfectly fine.\\n\\nEveryone thinks it's testosterone. Everyone thinks it's in your head. That's what the ads say. That's what your buddies joke about. Low T. Stress. Performance anxiety.\\n\\nBut that's not what does it.\\n\\nWhat does it is plumbing.\\n\\nAn erection is blood flow. That's all it is. When you're aroused, the lining of your blood vessels releases nitric oxide. Nitric oxide tells the vessels in your penis to relax and open. Blood rushes in.\\n\\nThat's the whole system.\\n\\nAnd those vessels are TINY. One to two millimeters wide. The ones feeding your heart are three to four.\\n\\nNow here's what nobody in this system will ever explain to you.\\n\\nThe plaque that clogs arteries doesn't start at 50. In 1953, Army pathologists autopsied 300 American soldiers killed in Korea. Average age 22. 77% already had plaque in the arteries of their hearts.\\n\\nTWENTY-TWO.\\n\\nIt starts young. It builds layer by layer. 10 years. 20 years. 30 years. Getting thicker. And the lining of your blood vessels, the part that makes nitric oxide, slowly stops keeping up.\\n\\nYou don't feel it happening.\\n\\nYou feel FINE.\\n\\nUntil you don't.\\n\\nAnd when the smallest arteries in your body finally can't keep up, which ones do you think go first?\\n\\nTHAT is why ED shows up 2 to 5 years before heart symptoms.\\n\\nTHAT is why men in their 40s with ED had roughly 50 times the rate of new heart disease in a large Mayo Clinic study.\\n\\nTHAT is what's behind every \\\"it happens to every guy\\\" your doctor shrugs off.\\n\\nNo awareness campaign. No ribbon. No billboard. Nothing.\\n\\nAnd you need to understand how this works. Because this isn't an accident. This is business.\\n\\nRight now, with just a \\\"small problem,\\\" you're barely worth the system's time. A ten-minute visit. A prescription. Next.\\n\\nThe blue pill doesn't touch your arteries. Not ONE millimeter. It blocks an enzyme for a few hours so blood can force its way through vessels that are already narrowing. When it wears off, you're exactly where you started.\\n\\nSo you keep buying it. $70 a pill for the brand name. Headaches. A red face. A 30-minute window to schedule your own sex life around.\\n\\nFor years. For the rest of your life.\\n\\nAnd by federal law, Medicare drug plans aren't even allowed to cover it. The most common early warning sign of heart disease in men, and you're paying out of pocket to cover it up.\\n\\nAnd you know what makes it even more sick?\\n\\nEvery doctor. Every article. Every website. Every person in a man's life says the same things first.\\n\\nLose the weight. Quit drinking. Cut the stress. Fix your diet. Get to the gym.\\n\\nTHEN we'll talk.\\n\\nA man told me once that admitting this problem to his doctor was harder than admitting he was drinking too much. Another told me he'd rather have a heart attack than tell his wife what was really going on. He was joking. Mostly.\\n\\nAnd that's exactly the problem.\\n\\n\\\"Fix your whole life first\\\" is step one. And for a 55-year-old man working 50 hours a week with a mortgage and a bad back, most men never get past step one. So they never get help. So they accept it. Stop initiating. Roll over at night.\\n\\nAnd the plaque keeps building.\\n\\nAnd the system keeps refilling the prescription.\\n\\nI'm not telling you to overhaul your whole life first.\\n\\nThose things matter. But your blood vessels don't care whether you've earned it. They don't care how many times you've tried and failed. They don't care how embarrassed you are.\\n\\nThe narrowing is there. And it needs support.\\n\\nYou do not need to earn the right to get hard.\\n\\nNow let me tell you what supports it. Because the science has been there for YEARS and the fact that nobody told you about it should make you furious.\\n\\nCapsaicin.\\n\\nThe active compound in cayenne pepper. Used for centuries. Studied for decades. Not a trend. In 2021, the Nobel Prize in Medicine went to the scientist who discovered the receptor capsaicin works on.\\n\\nIt's called TRPV1. And it sits in the lining of your blood vessels.\\n\\nLaboratory research shows that when capsaicin activates it, it switches on the enzyme your vessels use to MAKE nitric oxide.\\n\\nRead that again.\\n\\nThe blue pill holds the signal open for a few hours.\\n\\nCapsaicin works on the step that PRODUCES it.\\n\\nDifferent mechanism. Different point in the same pathway.\\n\\nI'd heard about cayenne for years. Tried it. Bought the capsules. The Amazon garbage.\\n\\nNothing. Except heartburn.\\n\\nI thought it was bullsh*t. For years I thought the whole thing was a scam.\\n\\nI was wrong. And finding out WHY I was wrong made me angrier than anything else.\\n\\nAlmost every cayenne supplement on the market is dry powder in a hard capsule.\\n\\nCapsaicin is fat-soluble. It needs oil to absorb properly. Powder barely does.\\n\\nSo it sits in your stomach. Burns. Gives you heartburn. And most of it never does what it's supposed to.\\n\\nTHAT'S why the capsules don't work. THAT'S why the teas don't work. THAT'S why every man who's tried cayenne thinks it's a scam.\\n\\nThe ingredient was right. Every cheap version they sold you was built wrong.\\n\\nPowder costs pennies to make. Dollars to sell. And when it fails, the man thinks he's tried everything and goes right back to the pill.\\n\\nSomeone built the version that works.\\n\\nCold-extracted heirloom Peruvian cayenne. 300mg per serving. Sealed in avocado oil inside a liquid softgel, so capsaicin is delivered the way it's meant to be absorbed.\\n\\nNo powder. No burn. No heartburn.\\n\\nBack to Dave.\\n\\nHe sat down with his brother-in-law at a barbecue and said something men almost never say out loud.\\n\\n\\\"I know what everyone's gonna tell me. Lose weight. Cut back on beer. I've heard it. I'm not there yet. I just want to stop rolling over at night pretending I'm tired.\\\"\\n\\nThen he said the thing that stuck.\\n\\nHis wife stopped reaching for him. It went from rarely, to almost never, to nothing. She stopped bringing it up.\\n\\nHe said, \\\"I think she's scared that if she asks, I'll have to admit something's wrong. So she just stopped asking.\\\"\\n\\n54 years old. His wife is afraid to touch him.\\n\\nHis brother-in-law handed him a bag of cayenne softgels. Told him: I'm not gonna lecture you. Just take two every morning.\\n\\nTwenty minutes after the first dose, Dave texts him.\\n\\n\\\"Why the f*ck are my hands warm?\\\"\\n\\nThat's circulation, Dave. That's your blood vessels opening up.\\n\\nFour weeks later he calls, losing his mind.\\n\\n\\\"Bro. I woke up with morning wood. I haven't had that in TWO YEARS.\\\"\\n\\nThat's your body's overnight blood flow test, Dave. And you just passed it.\\n\\n\\\"That's been possible this whole time?\\\"\\n\\nYes.\\n\\n\\\"And nobody told me?\\\"\\n\\nNo. Nobody told you.\\n\\nSix weeks in, Dave's not rolling over at night anymore.\\n\\nHis wife reached for him last Saturday. First time in months.\\n\\nShe said, \\\"What's gotten into you?\\\"\\n\\nThen Dave told his brother-in-law something he didn't expect.\\n\\nHe'd booked a heart checkup.\\n\\nNobody told him to. Nobody guilted him. Not because some ad finally scared him.\\n\\nBecause he finally understood what his body had been trying to tell him. If the smallest arteries were struggling, what about the big ones?\\n\\nThat's what got him. Not a lecture. Feeling the difference, and realizing what it meant.\\n\\nDave's still not perfect. He still has his beer on Fridays. That's his call.\\n\\nBut his blood is moving again. And his wife reaches for him again.\\n\\nThe formula is Aurivita Cayenne Pepper.\\n\\nThat plaque is building right now. In you. While you feel fine. While you think it's just age. While everyone you trust tells you it's normal. It's building, it's not stopping, and nobody is going to warn you.\\n\\nAurivita Cayenne Pepper. Link below.\\n\\nUp to 58% off for new customers, with a 120-day money-back guarantee. If nothing changes, you get every dollar back.\\n\\nYou don't have to overhaul your life first. You don't have to earn it. You don't have to prove sh*t to anyone.\\n\\nStop waiting for a system that makes money every time you refill that prescription to suddenly care about your blood flow.\\n\\nThey didn't care about Dave.\\n\\nThey don't care about you either.\\n\\nI'm sorry for swearing so much. But Dave's story really got to me. Look after yourselves.\",\"transcript\":