,"platform":"facebook","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-08-22T02:02:40.838Z","firstSeenAt":"2026-08-20T07:00:00.000Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-03T01:58:32.302Z","daysRunning":96,"media":{"type":"image","thumbnailUrl":null,"mediaUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/db80d60d21554d686b05fdb8e6a8511996f3d64cfc168ef923551bde1e02cd9e.png"},"advertiser":{"id":"1259243087276133","name":"Aurivita","logoUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/1259243087276133.jpg","facebookPageId":"1259243087276133","liveAdsCount":456,"reach30d":249222,"totalReach":1688650,"countriesCount":29,"facebookLikes":472,"instagramFollowers":null},"content":{"title":null,"body":"🚨 STOP scrolling — this is the deal of the year.\n\nAurivita Capsaicin Power — the cardiovascular formula thousands of men are crediting for cleaner circulation, stronger energy, and feeling like themselves again — just dropped 70% OFF.\n\nSix powerhouse compounds in ONE softgel. Capsaicin, beetroot, hawthorn, vitamin K2, and more. Pharmaceutical-grade. Made in the USA. Third-party tested. Zero synthetic fillers.\n\nMen are reporting:\n🔸 Cleaner circulation, head to toe\n🔸 More energy and sharper focus all day\n🔸 That confidence back — naturally\n\n🛡️ 120-day money-back guarantee. Zero risk, all upside.\n\n🟠 70% OFF Tap below before stock runs out!","transcript":null,"callToAction":"SHOP NOW","landingPageUrl":"https://aurivita.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels","landingPageDomain":"aurivita.co","ctaDescription":"70% OFF Today — Aurivita Capsaicin Power Is Back In Stock","ctaLinkDescription":"Support strong circulation today with our powerful cayenne pepper formula. 180 softgels and 60 servings per bag."},"metrics":{"reach":117344,"aggregatedReach":null,"estimatedSpend":1056,"duplicates":48,"reachDelta1d":319,"reachDelta7d":7715,"reachDelta30d":41269},"audience":{"targetedCountries":["AE","AT","AU","BE","BL","CA","CZ","DE","DK","ES","FI","FR","GB","GF","HK","IE","IL","IT","JP","KR","MY","NL","NZ","PF","PL","PT","SE","SG","US"],"mainCountry":"GB","gender":"all","ageMin":18,"ageMax":65},"rank":{"positionInPage":1,"currentRank":1,"rankDelta":3,"improvementPct":0.22},"flags":{"isEuAd":true,"isLowReach":true,"isMediaChanged":true,"hasPartnerBadge":false}},{"id":"facebook_1783004792907688","collationId":"1847029626945927","platform":"facebook","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-10-24T05:06:08.569Z","firstSeenAt":"2026-10-23T07:00:00.000Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-11-22T20:51:09.854Z","daysRunning":32,"media":{"type":"image","thumbnailUrl":null,"mediaUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/038b329fdfdf3cfb3e03ef54caf4d7afa7bb4ed7581946cf0839fe94c1ebd776.png"},"advertiser":{"id":"831176536748163","name":"Mary Harris","logoUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/831176536748163.jpg","facebookPageId":"831176536748163","liveAdsCount":98,"reach30d":91762,"totalReach":576893,"countriesCount":4,"facebookLikes":64,"instagramFollowers":null},"content":{"title":null,"body":"After 20 years in adult films, I’ve seen every “fix” men use to get hard and stay hard. So when my daughter asked me to rank them, I gave her the brutally honest answer, and most men will never hear it from anyone who actually knows (Serious Read)\n\nBecause if you knew how simple the real answer is, you’d probably be as annoyed as I was.\n\nLet me explain.\n\nI spent twenty years in front of a camera, in an industry where a man’s paycheck literally depended on it working. Every single day. On cue. With a crew watching and a clock running.\n\nSo trust me when I say I’ve seen every trick, every pill and every gadget men use to try to fix this.\n\nI’ve seen what works for a week.\n\nAnd I’ve seen what still works ten years later.\n\nSo when my daughter sat me down and said, “Mom, rank them for me, 1 through 10,” I didn’t sugarcoat a thing.\n\nHere’s what I told her.\n\nThe blue pill? A 1.\n\nAlmost every guy in the industry has stopped using it, because it’s a trap.\n\nThey start on fifty milligrams and it’s great. Five years in they’re on two hundred and it’s barely working.\n\nPlus the headaches. The vision problems. The feeling like their heart is going to come out of their chest.\n\nAnd when it finally stops working, they’re worse off than when they started.\n\nBecause the pill never fixed anything. It just forced blood through vessels that had stopped opening on their own. And after years of being forced, they forget how to do it by themselves.\n\nThink about it. If the pill actually fixed the problem, would you still need it every single time?\n\nPumps and rings? A 2.\n\nThe guys used them rarely, and only in emergencies.\n\nThere was real danger of messing things up down there. Using them regularly wrecks the tissue and shrinks the quality over time.\n\nSo they get you through one bad day, and cost you three good ones down the line.\n\nNobody serious relied on them.\n\nTestosterone? A 3.\n\nThe guys who lasted never needed it, because their drive never disappeared.\n\nTestosterone gives you the wanting. It doesn’t touch the vessels.\n\nSo even if your levels are low and you go on it, you end up wanting it more and still not being able to do it.\n\nThat’s worse, not better.\n\nCutting out adult content? A 6.\n\nI know. Funny coming from me.\n\nBut every guy I knew who was watching the stuff heavily on the side ran into the same thing.\n\nEvery day you jack off, you burn through your body’s nitric oxide. That’s the signal that tells the vessels down there to open.\n\nDo it enough for enough years and your body stops rebuilding that signal fast enough. The vessels stiffen. It fills part way and stops.\n\nQuitting gets a six because it can stop the damage from getting worse.\n\nBut it doesn’t rebuild the nitric oxide that gets the hard-ons back.\n\nAnd that’s the part almost nobody talks about.\n\nBecause here’s what twenty years on set taught me:\n\nIt was never about stress. It was never about age. It was never about testosterone.\n\nIt was always the vessels.\n\nAfter your mid-thirties, your body makes less nitric oxide every year. Less signal, the vessels open less, and the blood that’s supposed to get you hard and keep you hard just doesn’t get there.\n\nThat’s why it goes soft halfway through.\n\nThat’s why the morning wood disappears.\n\nThat’s why the pill works less every year.\n\nAnd that’s why the guys who lasted the longest in my industry, the ones still working in their fifties, all ended up doing the same thing.\n\nCapsaicin? A 10.\n\nIf I could go back to the beginning of my career and put one thing in every guy’s locker, every single day, it would be this.\n\nBecause it’s not a pill. It doesn’t force anything. It doesn’t wear off in an hour.\n\nIt doesn’t come with a needle or a rubber band or a countdown clock.\n\nIt flips the switch inside the vessels that tells your body to make its own nitric oxide, which is what actually gets you hard.\n\nAnd capsaicin sits above L-arginine and L-citrulline, which just dump raw material in and hope your vessels can still use it, which is why most nitric oxide supplements on the shelf don’t do anything.\n\nNow here’s the part I didn’t plan on telling my daughter.\n\nHer dad has been on it for the last four years.\n\nHe’s 62.\n\nHe has better morning wood now than he did at 45.\n\nNot because he’s on the pill. Not because he’s on testosterone.\n\nBecause the vessels are actually working.\n\nI watched it happen. Within the first couple of weeks, the mornings came back. By the second month he wasn’t thinking about it anymore. It just worked, the way it used to.\n\nAnd believe me, I’d know.\n\nSo of course, the next thing she asked was, “Where do people get it?”\n\nAnd that’s where I had to be careful, because most brands cut corners.\n\nThey underdose. They hide behind proprietary blends so you don’t know what you’re taking. Or they put the capsaicin in cheap seed oils that drive the inflammation you’re trying to fix.\n\nI found one American company called