rAdsCount":43,"activeAdsCount":7,"memberAdIdsTruncated":true,"warnings":["Reach history returned no numeric reach points, so trajectory is shown as unknown."],"analysis":{"hook":{"text":"If a diabetic with dangerously high blood sugar took three of these","source":"ad_transcripts_hook","sourceDescription":"Existing completed ad transcript hook.","isFallback":false},"hookPattern":"unclassified","hookPatternReason":"Hook text did not match a known opening pattern.","trajectory":"unknown","verdict":"History is inconclusive. Monitor the next few days before treating this as a scaler."},"data":{"id":"facebook_1557483932394826","collationId":"1322488153415901","platform":"facebook","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-07-01T05:07:36.904Z","firstSeenAt":"2026-06-30T07:00:00.000Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-11-23T03:49:47.029Z","daysRunning":147,"media":{"type":"video","thumbnailUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/9c5d39fe813b839ca101619d10dfb6b0576cd8ab4603af60f054a45a098c9395.jpg","mediaUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/36299772a303cc0fabebbac6d4199ed42b1edb5008da96816a3fe6ce8d214260.mp4"},"advertiser":{"id":"963879626812220","name":"Dr. Michael Harris","logoUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/963879626812220.jpg","facebookPageId":"963879626812220","liveAdsCount":48,"reach30d":19737,"totalReach":1012329,"countriesCount":25,"facebookLikes":438,"instagramFollowers":null},"content":{"title":null,"body":"Experience the Power of Aurivita Capsaicin Power!\n\n ✅ Supports healthy blood sugar response\n ✅ Helps ease diabetic numbness, burning feet, and cold hands\n ✅ Activates natural nitric oxide for better circulation\n ✅ Pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin\n ✅ 3mg therapeutic dose per serving\n ✅ BioPerine for 2000% absorption\n ✅ Plus Berberine, Cinnamon, D3 & K2\n\nStop fighting your blood sugar with pills that only manage the symptoms. Aurivita is formulated with seven science-backed ingredients that work together to rebuild your circulation and bring your numbers down at the root — backed by a 120-Day Risk-Free Guarantee.","transcript":"If a diabetic with dangerously high blood sugar took three of these soft gels every morning, here's what would happen. In just a few minutes, the capsaicin from 30,000 cayenne peppers gets to work. It's activating TRPV1 receptors, pumping a rapid surge of nitric oxide in your arteries. This opens up the pathways and spreads warmth back into the fingers and toes that have been numb and cold for years. Then beet root extract joins in, melting the stiffness in your vessel and improves circulation so the damaged nerves get fresh oxygen they need to start healing. In just one week, the burning in your feet quiets down, the tingling in your fingers fades, and the 3AM bathroom trips that have been wrecking your sleep finally stop. Meanwhile, berberine, known for being a natural metformin, rips those glucose out of your bloodstream and shoves it into the cells where it belongs. So your high blood sugar starts dropping on its own. At the same time, cinnamon and turmeric kick in, preventing sugar spikes after every meal. So you can finally eat any food you want without being anxious that the numbers go up. In just a few weeks, not only does your a one c go down, but your vision gets clearer, your feet feel warmer, and your energy during the day gets better. And because it also has the vitamins K2 and D3, it clears out all the sugar clogs and blockages, so the insulin hormone can finally pass through. By your next blood work, your A one C has already fallen a full point. Your doctor stares at the chart and looks surprised. He can't believe this would be possible. Thousands of diabetics have already watched their blood sugar stay high, but flipped it all around with Aura Vida. If you wanna lower your blood sugar naturally, grab your pack of Aura Vida today. Click below to get yours.","callToAction":"SHOP NOW","landingPageUrl":"https://aurivita.co/products/capsaicin-power-diabetes","landingPageDomain":"aurivita.co","ctaDescription":"Finally Take Control of Your Diabetes — Naturally","ctaLinkDescription":null},"metrics":{"reach":270515,"aggregatedReach":270515,"estimatedSpend":2435,"duplicates":43,"reachDelta1d":0,"reachDelta7d":2,"reachDelta30d":565},"audience":{"targetedCountries":["AE","AU","BE","CA","CZ","DE","DK","ES","FI","FR","GB","HK","IE","IL","IT","JP","KR","MY","NL","NZ","PL","PT","SE","SG","US"],"mainCountry":"GB","gender":"all","ageMin":18,"ageMax":65},"rank":{"positionInPage":5,"currentRank":5,"rankDelta":0,"improvementPct":10.42},"flags":{"isEuAd":true,"isLowReach":false,"isMediaChanged":true,"hasPartnerBadge":false},"transcript":{"language":"en","languageConfidence":0.99700475,"segments":[{"start":0,"end":3.84,"text":"If a diabetic with dangerously high blood sugar took three of these"},{"start":3.84,"end":6.48,"text":"soft gels every morning, here's what would happen."},{"start":6.48,"end":11.12,"text":"In just a few minutes, the capsaicin from 30,000 cayenne peppers gets"},{"start":11.12,"end":11.68,"text":"to work."},{"start":11.68,"end":16.83,"text":"It's activating TRPV1 receptors, pumping a rapid surge of nitric oxide in"},{"start":16.83,"end":17.63,"text":"your arteries."},{"start":17.63,"end":21.23,"text":"This opens up the pathways and spreads warmth back into the fingers"},{"start":21.23,"end":23.95,"text":"and toes that have been numb and cold for years."},{"start":23.95,"end":27.63,"text":"Then beet root extract joins in, melting the stiffness in your vessel"},{"start":27.63,"end":31.97,"text":"and improves circulation so the damaged nerves get fresh oxygen they need"},{"start":31.97,"end":32.77,"text":"to start healing."},{"start":32.77,"end":36.37,"text":"In just one week, the burning in your feet quiets down, the"},{"start":36.37,"end":40.29,"text":"tingling in your fingers fades, and the 3AM bathroom trips that have"},{"start":40.29,"end":42.39,"text":"been wrecking your sleep finally stop."},{"start":42.39,"end":47.18,"text":"Meanwhile, berberine, known for being a natural metformin, rips those glucose out"},{"start":47.18,"end":50.39,"text":"of your bloodstream and shoves it into the cells where it belongs."},{"start":50.39,"end":53.34,"text":"So your high blood sugar starts dropping on its own."},{"start":53.35,"end":57.07,"text":"At the same time, cinnamon and turmeric kick in, preventing sugar spikes"},{"start":57.07,"end":58.27,"text":"after every meal."},{"start":58.27,"end":61.39,"text":"So you can finally eat any food you want without being anxious"},{"start":61.39,"end":62.43,"text":"that the numbers go up."},{"start":62.43,"end":64.99,"text":"In just a few weeks, not only does your a one c"},{"start":64.99,"end":68.63,"text":"go down, but your vision gets clearer, your feet feel warmer, and"},{"start":68.63,"end":70.4,"text":"your energy during the day gets better."},{"start":70.4,"end":74.16,"text":"And because it also has the vitamins K2 and D3, it clears"},{"start":74.16,"end":78.08,"text":"out all the sugar clogs and blockages, so the insulin hormone can"},{"start":78.08,"end":79.19,"text":"finally pass through."},{"start":79.19,"end":82.65,"text":"By your next blood work, your A one C has already fallen"},{"start":82.65,"end":83.61,"text":"a full point."},{"start":83.61,"end":86.09,"text":"Your doctor stares at the chart and looks surprised."},{"start":86.17,"end":88.01,"text":"He can't believe this would be possible."},{"start":88.09,"end":92.01,"text":"Thousands of diabetics have already watched their blood sugar stay high, but"},{"start":92.01,"end":94.01,"text":"flipped it all around with Aura Vida."},{"start":94.01,"end":97.05,"text":"If you wanna lower your blood sugar naturally, grab your pack of"},{"start":97.05,"end":98.09,"text":"Aura Vida today."},{"start":98.09,"end":99.21,"text":"Click below to get yours."}],"fullText":"If a diabetic with dangerously high blood sugar took three of these soft gels every morning, here's what would happen. In just a few minutes, the capsaicin from 30,000 cayenne peppers gets to work. It's activating TRPV1 receptors, pumping a rapid surge of nitric oxide in your arteries. This opens up the pathways and spreads warmth back into the fingers and toes that have been numb and cold for years. Then beet root extract joins in, melting the stiffness in your vessel and improves circulation so the damaged nerves get fresh oxygen they need to start healing. In just one week, the burning in your feet quiets down, the tingling in your fingers fades, and the 3AM bathroom trips that have been wrecking your sleep finally stop. Meanwhile, berberine, known for being a natural metformin, rips those glucose out of your bloodstream and shoves it into the cells where it belongs. So your high blood sugar starts dropping on its own. At the same time, cinnamon and turmeric kick in, preventing sugar spikes after every meal. So you can finally eat any food you want without being anxious that the numbers go up. In just a few weeks, not only does your a one c go down, but your vision gets clearer, your feet feel warmer, and your energy during the day gets better. And because it also has the vitamins K2 and D3, it clears out all the sugar clogs and blockages, so the insulin hormone can finally pass through. By your next blood work, your A one C has already fallen a full point. Your doctor stares at the chart and looks surprised. He can't believe this would be possible. Thousands of diabetics have already watched their blood sugar stay high, but flipped it all around with Aura Vida. If you wanna lower your blood sugar naturally, grab your pack of Aura Vida today. Click below to get yours."},"creativeAnalysis":{"hook":{"text":"If a diabetic with dangerously high blood sugar took three of these","source":"ad_transcripts_hook","sourceDescription":"Existing completed ad transcript hook.","isFallback":false}},"links":{"adLibraryUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/?view_all_page_id=963879626812220&id=155