why stream, testosterone, and drive all collapse together — and why treating them separately never fixes any of them.\\n\\nAurivita Capsaicin Power addresses all three from the inside. Slow-extracted capsaicin from 30,000 cayenne peppers activates TRPV1 receptors and restarts natural nitric oxide production. Stinging Nettle supports prostate health. Turmeric and Ginger support healthy inflammation response. Suspended in oil so it actually reaches your prostate — not the dried powder that dies in stomach acid.\\n\\nMen are reporting:\\n🔸 Full stream returning — no more mapping every bathroom\\n🔸 Sleeping through the night for the first time in years\\n🔸 Morning responses back — spontaneously, without planning\\n🔸 Drive returning naturally\\n\\n🛡️ 120-day money-back guarantee.\\n\\n🟠 50% off while the sale's on. Tap below.\",\"transcript\":\"Your fucking prostate is the reason you can't get hard, your testosterone is tanked, and you piss 12 times a night. Here's what to do to fix all three. Every night your inflamed prostate is silently squeezing your bladder shut and choking the blood to your dick. That's why you piss 12 times a night, why your testosterone is tanked, and why you can't get hard for your wife. Most men don't realize the damage until their drive is almost gone. Here are the four ingredients that actually shrink your prostate. Stinging nettle to crush the swelling. Turmeric and ginger to kill the inflammation. And the one nobody talks about, slow-extracted cayenne suspended in oil, which fires the nitric oxide that relaxes your prostate and brings blood back to your dick. You could go source all four separately. Or you can grab all four already combined, at clinical strength in one soft gel, called Ora Vita Capsaicin Power. Slow-extracted from 30,000 cayenne peppers, suspended in oil so it actually reaches your prostate. No burn. No heartburn. Three soft gels a day. When you take Ora Vita every morning, your prostate starts shrinking, your bladder stops getting squeezed, blood comes back to your dick, your drive returns, and your performance comes back. Ora Vita is 50% off right now, with a 120-day money-back guarantee. If your prostate doesn't shrink and your drive doesn't come back, every dollar back. Link below. Grab it before this batch sells out.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/collections/bph\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Flomax manages it. It doesn't fix it.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":528802,\"aggregatedReach\":528802,\"estimatedSpend\":4759,\"duplicates\":152,\"reachDelta1d\":146,\"reachDelta7d\":464,\"reachDelta30d\":5681},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BL\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":13,\"currentRank\":13,\"rankDelta\":4,\"improvementPct\":2.65},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false},\"transcript\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"languageConfidence\":1,\"segments\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":3.98,\"text\":\"Your fucking prostate is the reason you can't get hard, your testosterone is tanked, and\"},{\"start\":3.98,\"end\":5.44,\"text\":\"you piss 12 times a night.\"},{\"start\":5.44,\"end\":7.2,\"text\":\"Here's what to do to fix all three.\"},{\"start\":7.2,\"end\":11.6,\"text\":\"Every night your inflamed prostate is silently squeezing your bladder shut and choking the\"},{\"start\":11.6,\"end\":12.88,\"text\":\"blood to your dick.\"},{\"start\":12.88,\"end\":16.96,\"text\":\"That's why you piss 12 times a night, why your testosterone is tanked, and why you can't\"},{\"start\":16.96,\"end\":18.5,\"text\":\"get hard for your wife.\"},{\"start\":18.5,\"end\":21.84,\"text\":\"Most men don't