efore this batch sells out.\"}],\"fullText\":\"Your fucking prostate is the reason you can't get hard, your testosterone is tanked, and you piss 12 times a night. Here's what to do to fix all three. Every night your inflamed prostate is silently squeezing your bladder shut and choking the blood to your dick. That's why you piss 12 times a night, why your testosterone is tanked, and why you can't get hard for your wife. Most men don't realize the damage until their drive is almost gone. Here are the four ingredients that actually shrink your prostate. Stinging nettle to crush the swelling. Turmeric and ginger to kill the inflammation. And the one nobody talks about, slow-extracted cayenne suspended in oil, which fires the nitric oxide that relaxes your prostate and brings blood back to your dick. You could go source all four separately. Or you can grab all four already combined, at clinical strength in one soft gel, called Ora Vita Capsaicin Power. Slow-extracted from 30,000 cayenne peppers, suspended in oil so it actually reaches your prostate. No burn. No heartburn. Three soft gels a day. When you take Ora Vita every morning, your prostate starts shrinking, your bladder stops getting squeezed, blood comes back to your dick, your drive returns, and your performance comes back. Ora Vita is 50% off right now, with a 120-day money-back guarantee. If your prostate doesn't shrink and your drive doesn't come back, every dollar back. Link below. Grab it before this batch sells out.\"},\"creativeAnalysis\":{\"hook\":{\"text\":\"Your fucking prostate is the reason you can't get hard, your testosterone is tanked, and\",\"source\":\"ad_transcripts_hook\",\"sourceDescription\":\"Existing completed ad transcript hook.\",\"isFallback\":false}},\"links\":{\"adLibraryUrl\":\"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/?view_all_page_id=860657403805344&id=1046140877903988\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/collections/bph\"},\"shops\":[{\"shopId\":\"3ca4ca1f-1722-4a3c-a92a-ba2e5108