 here. I've been trying to tell you the plumbing is failing and you out here acting like everything's cool. You keep blaming me for not showing up, but have you ever once asked what I need? Nah, you just get mad, pop a blue pill and pray to God it works. And here's what nobody told you, brah. Those pills were never going to work for you the way they work for other men. That artery feeding me is one of the smallest in your whole body and years of high blood sugar scarred it up, narrowed it, made it stiff. A blue pill just forces blood through a damaged vessel for an hour, then quits. It ain't fixing the vessel. That's why you keep getting let down. So let me tell you exactly what I actually need. First, capsaicin. This is the big one. My supply line is scarred and barely letting a trickle through. Capsaicin wakes the vessel wall and forces these scarred vessels wide open. So blood actually gets down here again. Second, beetroot. Opens your circulation even wider and floods with the nitric oxide that keeps those vessels wide open long after capsaicin cracks them awake. Third, Korean red ginseng. Remember when I woke you up every single morning ready to go? That was your drive. Diabetes buried it under stress and ginseng breaks it loose. Fourth, berberine. Ginseng frees up what's already there. Berberine goes to the source and drops the blood sugar that scarred me up so nothing damages me again. Fifth, bioperine. Because diabetic gut could take all four of those and still lose most of it before it reaches me. Bioperine makes sure you absorb all so nothing is wasted. That's five. That's what I've been asking for this whole time. You could run around buying five different bottles and forget to take half of them like you forget everything else. Or you could just get Aura Vida. All five in one soft gel, three soft gels a day and I'm fed. Give me two weeks and I'll start waking you up in the morning again like the old days. Give me 30 days and your wife gonna be looking at you different. Five ingredients, one mission. Getting blood flow back where diabetes cut it off. 100% natural. No needles, no clinic, no blue pills with side effects down here if you know what I mean. I know you've been burned before. That's why there's a money back guarantee. Worst case you take every last capsule and they pay you back anyway. Best case you join tens of thousands of men who got their blood flow back and started waking up hard again. Come on man, links below. Do this for us. We used to be a good team. Let's get back to it.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/pages/adv-general-ed-listicle\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"You're diabetic. Here's what's happening down there.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Join 150,000+ Happy Customers!\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":211244,\"aggregatedReach\":211244,\"estimatedSpend\":1901,\"duplicates\":28,\"reachDelta1d\":82,\"reachDelta7d\":2852,\"reachDelta30d\":50778},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"SG\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":3,\"currentRank\":3,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":0.51},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false},\"transcript\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"languageConfidence\":0.99951171875,\"segments\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":4.96,\"text\":\"Yo, it's your dick speaking. Stop popping blue pills and blaming me. You're diabetic. Let me\"},{\"start\":4.96,\"end\":9.120000000000001,\"text\":\"tell you what's actually going on down here. I've been trying to tell you the plumbing is failing\"},{\"start\":9.120000000000001,\"end\":14.3,\"text\":\"and you out here acting like everything's cool. You keep blaming me for not showing up,\"},{\"start\":14.38,\"end\":20.38,\"text\":\"but have you ever once asked what I need? Nah, you just get mad, pop a blue pill and pray to\"},{\"start\":20