,\"text\":\"and ginseng breaks it loose. Fourth, berberine. Ginseng frees up what's already there. Berberine goes to\"},{\"start\":82.8,\"end\":88.88,\"text\":\"the source and drops the blood sugar that scarred me up so nothing damages me again. Fifth, bioperine.\"},{\"start\":89.1,\"end\":93.62,\"text\":\"Because diabetic gut could take all four of those and still lose most of it before it reaches me.\"},{\"start\":94.02000000000001,\"end\":99.88,\"text\":\"Bioperine makes sure you absorb all so nothing is wasted. That's five. That's what I've been asking for\"},{\"start\":99.88,\"end\":105.52,\"text\":\"this whole time. You could run around buying five different bottles and forget to take half of them\"},{\"start\":105.52,\"end\":111.22,\"text\":\"like you forget everything else. Or you could just get Aura Vida. All five in one soft gel, three soft\"},{\"start\":111.22,\"end\":118.38,\"text\":\"gels a day and I'm fed. Give me two weeks and I'll start waking you up in the morning again like the old\"},{\"start\":118.38,\"end\":125.14,\"text\":\"days. Give me 30 days and your wife gonna be looking at you different. Five ingredients, one mission.\"},{\"start\":125.14,\"end\":131.36,\"text\":\"Getting blood flow back where diabetes cut it off. 100% natural. No needles, no clinic,\"},{\"start\":131.68,\"end\":136.38,\"text\":\"no blue pills with side effects down here if you know what I mean. I know you've been burned before.\"},{\"start\":136.62,\"end\":141.44,\"text\":\"That's why there's a money back guarantee. Worst case you take every last capsule and they pay you\"},{\"start\":141.44,\"end\":147.32,\"text\":\"back anyway. Best case you join tens of thousands of men who got their blood flow back and started\"},{\"start\":147.32,\"end\":153.68,\"text\":\"waking up hard again. Come on man, links below. Do this for us. We used to be a good team. Let's get back to it.\"}],\"fullText\":\"Yo, it's your dick speaking. Stop popping blue pills and blaming me. You're diabet