ady there. Berberine goes to the source and drops the blood sugar that scarred me up so nothing damages me again. Fifth, bioperine. Because diabetic gut could take all four of those and still lose most of it before it reaches me. Bioperine makes sure you absorb all so nothing is wasted. That's five. That's what I've been asking for this whole time. You could run around buying five different bottles and forget to take half of them like you forget everything else. Or you could just get Aura Vida. All five in one soft gel, three soft gels a day and I'm fed. Give me two weeks and I'll start waking you up in the morning again like the old days. Give me 30 days and your wife gonna be looking at you different. Five ingredients, one mission. Getting blood flow back where diabetes cut it off. 100% natural. No needles, no clinic, no blue pills with side effects down here if you know what I mean. I know you've been burned before. That's why there's a money back guarantee. Worst case you take every last capsule and they pay you back anyway. Best case you join tens of thousands of men who got their blood flow back and started waking up hard again. Come on man, links below. Do this for us. We used to be a good team. Let's get back to it.","callToAction":"SHOP NOW","landingPageUrl":"https://aurivita.co/pages/adv-general-ed-listicle","landingPageDomain":"aurivita.co","ctaDescription":"You're diabetic. Here's what's happening down there.","ctaLinkDescription":"Join 150,000+ Happy Customers!"},"metrics":{"reach":211244,"aggregatedReach":211244,"estimatedSpend":1901,"duplicates":28,"reachDelta1d":82,"reachDelta7d":2852,"reachDelta30d":50778},"audience":{"targetedCountries":["AU","CA","GB","NZ","SG","US"],"mainCountry":"GB","gender":null,"ageMin":null,"ageMax":null},"rank":{"positionInPage":3,"currentRank":3,"rankDelta":0,"improvementPct":0.51},"flags":{"isEuAd":null,"isLowReach":false,"isMediaChanged":true,"hasPartnerBadge":false},"transcript":{"language":"en","languageConfidence":0.9