"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feeling cold, tired, or sluggish more often than you’d like?\\n\\nVitalia® Cayenne Pepper Softgels are made with cayenne pepper, beetroot, turmeric, ginseng, and grape seed extract — ingredients traditionally used to support circulation, cardiovascular health, and daily energy.\\n\\n✨ Supports healthy blood flow\\n✨ Helps maintain natural energy levels\\n✨ Plant-based formula\\n✨ No jitters or crashes\\n\\nSimple daily support designed to help you feel more active and energised.\",\"transcript\":\"Is it true you can flush all the sugar out of your blood through your urine? Yes. And it's something ninety eight percent of diabetics have no clue about. I'm a pancreatic cancer research doctor, and if I were going to die tomorrow, I'd want every diabetic, including you, to stop asking God to deliver you from type two diabetes. He already sent the answer. You're the one refusing to reach for it. Now I'm going to spit in the face of big pharma and expose the three biggest lies they tell you about type two diabetes. By the end, you'll know how to reverse this curse once and for all. Give me sixty seconds to explain. Lie number one. Type two diabetes is caused by eating sugar or getting old. That's outdated. Type two diabetes is actually a circulation disease, not a sugar disease. The high blood sugar is only the smoke. The real fire is your blood vessels stiffening and shutting circulation to your eyes, your kidneys, your feet, and your nerves. That's why cutting carbs, fasting, or walking for hours is useless. Lie number two: Metformin or insulin fix the problem. That's ridiculous. Those drugs only mask the symptoms and are loaded with side effects that destroy you piece by piece. It's like spraying perfume on a garbage dump. Lie number three: Type two diabetes is irreversible, and you'll be a diabetic until the day you die. It's criminal that they keep telling you this. Research has proven that combining high Scoville cayenne with beetroot, hawthorn, ginseng, and black pepper reaches the tiny capillaries diabetes destroys and drops your blood sugar below 100 in a few hours. This was proven in more than eighty six thousand people with type two diabetes and ninety seven percent of them completely reversed the disease in less than two weeks. And the best part, you take two softgels a night and that's it, costs less than 60¢. Thousands of Americans are already using this to finally eat whatever they want without terror. They wake up full of energy and drive and live without the constant fear of losing their vision, their feet or their kidneys. This method is so powerful that I emptied the diabetes ward at the hospital where I work after I started putting my patients on this simple solution. But as you can imagine, big pharma, making billions off the diabetics like you, is furious about it. Right now, the lawyers for these legalized drug dealers are doing everything they can to bury this discovery and keep you hostage to meds for the rest of your life. That's why I'm leaving the link below to Vitalia Cayenne Pepper, the exact formula that combines those five compounds in a single soft gel with the fat absorption already built in. So your body actually pulls the capsaicin into the bloodstream. It comes with a full thirty day money back guarantee, so you can start doing this at home today. This is your real chance to reverse diabetes once and for all and go back to eating pasta and donuts without a worry. Two softgels a day is all you need to keep your A1C moving down for the first time in years. And every batch is third party tested in The United States before it reaches you. Which is why it works, while the cheap cayenne on Amazon does nothing for a diabetic body. Tap the link below right now, and if the buy one get three free deal is still up, consider yourself blessed. This natural formula is the answer. Don't waste this chance.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopvitalia.co/products/cayenne-pepper-softgels-diabetes-angle\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopvitalia.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Feel Warmer, Lighter & More Energised\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":163193,\"aggregatedReach\":163193,\"estimatedSpend\":1469,\"duplicates\":9,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":0,\"reachDelta30d\":318},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":57,\"currentRank\":57,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":35.85},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false},\"transcript\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"languageConfidence\":0.99816865,\"segments\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":2.32,\"text\":\"Is it true you can flush all the sugar out of your\"},{\"start\":2.32,\"end\":3.52,\"text\":\"blood through your urine?\"},{\"start\":3.6,\"end\":4.24,\"text\":\"Yes.\"},{\"start\":4.48,\"end\":7.68,\"text\":\"And it's something ninety eight percent of diabetics have no clue about.\"},{\"start\":7.68,\"end\":10.64,\"text\":\"I'm a pancreatic cancer research doctor, and if I were going to\"},{\"start\":10.64,\"end\":14.35,\"text\":\"die tomorrow, I'd want every diabetic, including you, to stop asking God\"},{\"start\":14.35,\"end\":16.18,\"text\":\"to deliver you from type two diabetes.\"},{\"start\":16.35,\"end\":17.63,\"text\":\"He already sent the answer.\"},{\"start\":17.63,\"end\":19.47,\"text\":\"You're the one refusing to reach for it.\"},{\"start\":19.47,\"end\":22.11,\"text\":\"Now I'm going to spit in the face of big pharma and\"},{\"start\":22.11,\"end\":25.79,\"text\":\"expose the three biggest lies they tell you about type two diabetes.\"},{\"start\":26.08,\"end\":28.72,\"text\":\"By the end, you'll know how to reverse this curse once and\"},{\"start\":28.72,\"end\":29.2,\"text\":\"for all.\"},{\"start\":29.2,\"end\":31.12,\"text\":\"Give me sixty seconds to explain.\"},{\"start\":31.12,\"end\":32.08,\"text\":\"Lie number one.\"},{\"start\":32.08,\"end\":36.24,\"text\":\"Type two diabetes is caused by eating sugar or getting old.\"},{\"start\":36.24,\"end\":37.28,\"text\":\"That's outdated.\"},{\"start\":37.36,\"end\":42.07,\"text\":\"Type two diabetes is actually a circulation disease, not a sugar disease.\"},{\"start\":42.14,\"end\":44.39,\"text\":\"The high blood sugar is only the smoke.\"},{\"start\":44.39,\"end\":48.39,\"text\":\"The real fire is your blood vessels stiffening and shutting circulation to\"},{\"start\":48.39,\"end\":51.75,\"text\":\"your eyes, your kidneys, your feet, and your nerves.\"},{\"start\":51.75,\"end\":55.5,\"text\":\"That's why cutting carbs, fasting, or walking for hours is useless.\"},{\"start\":55.87,\"end\":58.83,\"text\":\"Lie number two: Metformin or insulin fix the problem.\"},{\"start\":58.83,\"end\":59.79,\"text\":\"That's ridiculous.\"},{\"start\":59.87,\"end\":63.55,\"text\":\"Those drugs only mask the symptoms and are loaded with side effects\"},{\"start\":63.55,\"end\":65.55,\"text\":\"that destroy you piece by piece.\"},{\"start\":65.63,\"end\":67.71,\"text\":\"It's like spraying perfume on a garbage dump.\"},{\"start\":67.89,\"end\":71.65,\"text\":\"Lie number three: Type two diabetes is irreversible, and you'll be a\"},{\"start\":71.65,\"end\":73.08,\"text\":\"diabetic until the day you die.\"},{\"start\":73.08,\"end\":74.77,\"text\":\"It's criminal that they keep telling you this.\"},{\"start\":74.77,\"end\":79.81,\"text\":\"Research has proven that combining high Scoville cayenne with beetroot, hawthorn,\"},{\"start\":79.81,\"end\":84.7,\"text\":\"ginseng, and black pepper reaches the tiny capillaries diabetes destroys and drops\"},{\"start\":84.7,\"end\":87.18,\"text\":\"your blood sugar below 100 in a few hours.\"},{\"start\":87.18,\"end\":90.22,\"text\":\"This was proven in more than eighty six thousand people with type\"},{\"start\":90.22,\"end\":94.06,\"text\":\"two diabetes and ninety seven percent of them completely reversed the disease\"},{\"start\":94.06,\"end\":95.1,\"text\":\"in less than two weeks.\"},{\"start\":95.5,\"end\":98.46,\"text\":\"And the best part, you take two softgels a night and that's\"},{\"start\":98.46,\"end\":100.62,\"text\":\"it, costs less than 60¢.\"},{\"start\":100.78,\"end\":105.02,\"text\":\"Thousands of Americans are already using this to finally eat whatever they\"},{\"start\":105.02,\"end\":106.3,\"text\":\"want without terror.\"},{\"start\":106.38,\"end\":109.66,\"text\":\"They wake up full of energy and drive and live without the\"},{\"start\":109.66,\"end\":113.82,\"text\":\"constant fear of losing their vision, their feet or their kidneys.\"},{\"start\":113.9,\"end\":117.66,\"text\":\"This method is so powerful that I emptied the diabetes ward at\"},{\"start\":117.66,\"end\":121.18,\"text\":\"the hospital where I work after I started putting my patients on\"},{\"start\":121.18,\"end\":122.06,\"text\":\"this simple solution.\"},{\"start\":122.53,\"end\":126.45,\"text\":\"But as you can imagine, big pharma, making billions off the diabetics\"},{\"start\":126.45,\"end\":128.53,\"text\":\"like you, is furious about it.\"},{\"start\":128.53,\"end\":132.29,\"text\":\"Right now, the lawyers for these legalized drug dealers are doing everything\"},{\"start\":132.29,\"end\":135.89,\"text\":\"they can to bury this discovery and keep you hostage to meds\"},{\"start\":135.89,\"end\":136.85,\"text\":\"for the rest of your life.\"},{\"start\":137.04,\"end\":141.04,\"text\":\"That's why I'm leaving the link below to Vitalia Cayenne Pepper, the\"},{\"start\":141.04,\"end\":145.36,\"text\":\"exact formula that combines those five compounds in a single soft gel\"},{\"start\":145.36,\"end\":147.84,\"text\":\"with the fat absorption already built in.\"},{\"start\":147.92,\"end\":151.53,\"text\":\"So your body actually pulls the capsaicin into the bloodstream.\"},{\"start\":151.53,\"end\":154.72,\"text\":\"It comes with a 