 hours is useless."},{"start":55.87,"end":58.83,"text":"Lie number two: Metformin or insulin fix the problem."},{"start":58.83,"end":59.79,"text":"That's ridiculous."},{"start":59.87,"end":63.55,"text":"Those drugs only mask the symptoms and are loaded with side effects"},{"start":63.55,"end":65.55,"text":"that destroy you piece by piece."},{"start":65.63,"end":67.71,"text":"It's like spraying perfume on a garbage dump."},{"start":67.89,"end":71.65,"text":"Lie number three: Type two diabetes is irreversible, and you'll be a"},{"start":71.65,"end":73.08,"text":"diabetic until the day you die."},{"start":73.08,"end":74.77,"text":"It's criminal that they keep telling you this."},{"start":74.77,"end":79.81,"text":"Research has proven that combining high Scoville cayenne with beetroot, hawthorn,"},{"start":79.81,"end":84.7,"text":"ginseng, and black pepper reaches the tiny capillaries diabetes destroys and drops"},{"start":84.7,"end":87.18,"text":"your blood sugar below 100 in a few hours."},{"start":87.18,"end":90.22,"text":"This was proven in more than eighty six thousand people with type"},{"start":90.22,"end":94.06,"text":"two diabetes and ninety seven percent of them completely reversed the disease"},{"start":94.06,"end":95.1,"text":"in less than two weeks."},{"start":95.5,"end":98.46,"text":"And the best part, you take two softgels a night and that's"},{"start":98.46,"end":100.62,"text":"it, costs less than 60¢."},{"start":100.78,"end":105.02,"text":"Thousands of Americans are already using this to finally eat whatever they"},{"start":105.02,"end":106.3,"text":"want without terror."},{"start":106.38,"end":109.66,"text":"They wake up full of energy and drive and live without the"},{"start":109.66,"end":113.82,"text":"constant fear of losing their vision, their feet or their kidneys."},{"start":113.9,"end":117.66,"text":"This method is so powerful that I emptied the diabetes ward at"},{"start":117.66,"end":121.18,"text":"the hospital where I work after I started putting my patients on"},{"start":121.18,"end":122.06,"text":"this simple solution."},{"start":122.53,"end":126.45,"text":"But as you can imagine, big pharma, making billions off the diabetics"},{"start":126.45,"end":128.53,"text":"like you, is furious about it."},{"start":128.53,"end":132.29,"text":"Right now, the lawyers for these legalized drug dealers are doing everything"},{"start":132.29,"end":135.89,"text":"they can to bury this discovery and keep you hostage to meds"},{"start":135.89,"end":136.85,"text":"for the rest of your life."},{"start":137.04,"end":141.04,"text":"That's why I'm leaving the link below to Vitalia Cayenne Pepper, the"},{"start":141.04,"end":145.36,"text":"exact formula that combines those five compounds in a single soft gel"},{"start":145.36,"end":147.84,"text":"with the fat absorption already built in."},{"start":147.92,"end":151.53,"text":"So your body actually pulls the capsaicin into the bloodstream."},{"start":151.53,"end":154.72,"text":"It comes with a full thirty day money back guarantee, so you"},{"start":154.72,"end":156.49,"text":"can start doing this at home today."},{"start":156.49,"end":159.93,"text":"This is your real chance to reverse diabetes once and for all"},{"start":159.93,"end":162.97,"text":"and go back to eating pasta and donuts without a worry."},{"start":162.97,"end":166.83,"text":"Two softgels a day is all you need to keep your A1C"},{"start":166.83,"end":169.07,"text":"moving down for the first time in years."},{"start":169.07,"end":172.27,"text":"And every batch is third party tested in The United States before"},{"start":172.27,"end":173.23,"text":"it reaches you."},{"start":173.23,"end":176.67,"text":"Which is why it works, while the cheap cayenne on Amazon does"},{"start":176.67,"end":178.19,"text":"nothing for a diabetic body."},{"start":178.54,"end":181.18,"text":"Tap the link below right now, and if the buy one get"},{"start":181.18,"end":184.22,"text":"three free deal is still up, consider yourself blessed."