een missing for years. No climbing doses. No needles. No \\\"planning.\\\" No permission slip from a doctor who'd rather sell you a subscription.\\n\\nIt works with your diabetes routine, not against it. Two softgels a day. That's the whole protocol.\\n\\nThousands of diabetic men have quietly thrown out the pills and never looked back — and most say their only regret is the years they wasted waiting.\\n\\nYour window doesn't stay open forever. Every month that circulation keeps slipping, the harder it is to bring back.\\n\\n👉 Take the 60-second quiz now to see if you qualify — and unlock up to 50% off before it's gone.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://go.aurivita.co/bd\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"go.aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Diabetic With ED? The Blue Pill Is Making It Worse.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Weak flow and weak erections run off the same supply line. Find your profile and get your 90-day plan.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":null,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":310,\"currentRank\":310,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":84.93},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":1,\"total\":2533,\"totalPages\":2533,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":null,\"keywords\":[\"cayenne\",\"circulation\"],\"searchIn\":\"ad_copy\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"newest\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":1,\"effectiveLimit\":1,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"active\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGro