pUnits\":0,\"creditsRemaining\":2520,\"creditsSourceHeader\":\"recurring\",\"failurePhase\":null,\"releaseAttempted\":false,\"releaseSucceeded\":null}}","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"trendtrack-server","version":"0.0.1"}},"structuredContent":{"requestId":"7be4f2d8-7c02-421e-9154-e56a9c4348db","data":[{"id":"facebook_1204385068582244","platform":"facebook","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-11-23T20:30:45.943Z","firstSeenAt":"2026-11-23T08:00:00.000Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-11-23T20:31:40.464Z","daysRunning":1,"media":{"type":"image","thumbnailUrl":null,"mediaUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/418264296770fa5602300f199ec6126ecac68d2e1d8ee6a513f65085438c21c3.png"},"advertiser":{"id":"944867892040477","name":"Men's Health Insider","logoUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/944867892040477.jpg","facebookPageId":"944867892040477","liveAdsCount":530,"reach30d":268368,"totalReach":3971285,"countriesCount":1,"facebookLikes":1604,"instagramFollowers":null},"content":{"title":null,"body":"If you are a diabetic man dealing with ED issues… stop taking that little blue pill before you read this.\n\nBecause what nobody told you is that the pill isn't saving your sex life. It's quietly ending it.\n\nHere's the dirty secret the prescription pad hides: every single time you pop one, your body fights back. It builds a wall. The dose that gave you a night to remember last year? Today it barely gets you off the couch. Next year it'll do nothing at all. That's the tolerance trap — and for diabetic men, it slams shut twice as fast.\n\nAnd when the pills stop working? That's when they come for your wallet. Stronger scripts. Then injections — a needle, down there, before every encounter. Then pumps. Then implants. A surgeon. Because the whole system was never built to fix you. It was built to keep you coming back, month after month, refill after refill, for the rest of your life.\n\nThey'll never tell you why, so I will.\n\nIt was never a bedroom problem. It was a plumbing problem.\n\nYour blood sugar has been silently strangling the tiny vessels that feed everything below the belt. High glucose stiffens the pipes and chokes off your nitric oxide — the exact signal your body uses to send blood where it counts. Metformin babysits the number on your chart while, underneath, your circulation is drying up like a riverbed in August. The pill just whips your exhausted system harder to force one more result… while the real damage gets worse in the dark.\n\nSo you can keep renting erections from a pharmacy that profits off your decline…\n\n…or you can go after the thing choking the blood flow in the first place.\n\nThere's one compound on Earth powerful enough to do it. Capsaicin — from authentic Peruvian cayenne. It fires your TRPV1 receptors and floods your body with nitric oxide, blasting your vessels back open and driving fresh blood exactly where it's been missing for years. No climbing doses. No needles. No \"planning.\" No permission slip from a doctor who'd rather sell you a subscription.\n\nIt works with your diabetes routine, not against it. Two softgels a day. That's the whole protocol.\n\nThousands of diabetic men have quietly thrown out the pills and never looked back — and most say their only regret is the years they wasted waiting.\n\nYour window doesn't stay open forever. Every month that circulation keeps slipping, the harder it is to bring back.\n\n👉 Take the 60-second quiz now to see if you qualify — and unlock up to 50% off before it's gone.","transcript":null,"callToAction":"LEARN MORE","landingPageUrl":"https://go.aurivita.co/bd","landingPageDomain":"go.aurivita.co","ctaDescription":"Diabetic With ED? The Blue Pill Is Making It Worse.","ctaLinkDescription":"Weak flow and weak erections run off the same supply line. Find your profile and get your 90-day plan."},"metrics":{"reach":null,"aggregatedReach":null,"estimatedSpend":null,"duplicates":null,"reachDelta1d":null,"reachDelta7d":null,"r