{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013B5B7gc7oe9csfWFnUoarM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"f76f2ab3-6b7b-4519-8ef6-fb664c69be82\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1191666763371515\",\"collationId\":\"2740287273074987\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-23T13:20:28.983Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-24T12:27:33.629Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6d1759f0463ae656fea5978cf40a2b2eed4e1d023046b11e0a623214ff301875.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/6e1451db81efdfa79d9f5634d765be5224a9233dcd0967c387450ed5024fbbb3.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"698499393345194\",\"name\":\"Could This End Your Sciatica Pain?\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/698499393345194.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"698499393345194\",\"liveAdsCount\":361,\"reach30d\":102415,\"totalReach\":2571709,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":3681,\"instagramFollowers\":15},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"🤔 Still the same guy. Just… less of him when it counts.\\n\\nYou still hit the gym. You still eat right. But something's quietly slipping. And you know exactly what it is.\\n\\nIt's not age. It's not stress. It's blood flow. When your vessels narrow and nitric oxide drops, less blood reaches where it needs to go. That's it. That's the whole problem.\\n\\nAurivita Cayenne Pepper Softgels open the pipes back up. Cayenne, Beetroot, Ginseng, Turmeric, and 8 more natural compounds working together to get your circulation moving strong again.\\n\\nMen are reporting:\\n✅ Solid, reliable performance — no pills, no planning\\n✅ More energy and sharpness through the whole day\\n✅ That confidence back. Spontaneously. Naturally.\\n\\n🛡️ Backed by thousands of happy customers.\\n🟠 Return to Solid. Tap below to shop up to 50% of\",\"transcript\":n