{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FDa3AcNDtsWdtmoQMJwMv3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"2150bfcf-1e96-4072-b172-ce7a00eb7b61\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_2266701140836756\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-23T20:30:45.943Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T20:31:40.464Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/5918e7ae74635ead8e3b5c7ce2258195242673d54ae40c444d28408721d25616.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"944867892040477\",\"name\":\"Men's Health Insider\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/944867892040477.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"944867892040477\",\"liveAdsCount\":530,\"reach30d\":268368,\"totalReach\":3971285,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":1604,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"What the fuck happens if a man with erectile dysfunction takes cayenne pepper softgels for 30 days.\\n\\nWithin the first few days something shifts. Not in the bedroom yet. In the background. The energy is different. The fog behind the eyes lifts. The 2pm crash that has been hitting every single day for years just does not arrive. Something in the plumbing is waking up.\\n\\nThat is the capsaicin activating TRPV1 receptors on the cells lining his blood vessels. Every blood vessel. Including the ones feeding the erectile tissue. Restarting nitric oxide production inside the vessel wall for the first time in years. The molecule that opens blood vessels is flowing again. Blood is reaching tissue it has not reached properly in a decade.\\n\\nAnd his body is like. Where the hell has this circulation been all this time.\\n\\nBy the end of week one he notices his hands are warm. His feet are warm. The cold extremities he blamed on aging were not aging. They were nitric oxide depletion in the smallest vessels. The smallest vessels recover first because they respond fastest to the restart. The hands and feet are the preview. The penile vessels are next in line.\\n\\nBy week two something happens that has not happened in months. Maybe longer.\\n\\nHe wakes up hard.\\n\\nNot the half-effort that fades before he gets out of bed. Not the ghost of a response that might have been something or might have been nothing. Hard. Actually hard. At 6am. With nobody touching him. With no pill in his system. With nothing happening except biology.\\n\\nMorning erections are driven entirely by nitric oxide. No arousal. No psychology. No desire. Just the endothelial cells lining the penile blood vessels producing the molecule during sleep. If the morning erection is there the cells are producing. If it has been absent the cells were shut down. And the capsaicin just turned them back on.\\n\\nHe lies there for a minute processing what just happened. Because it has been a long time. And the return of the thing he stopped expecting feels different from what he imagined it would feel like. It does not feel like a victory. It feels like a correction. Like the body remembering something it forgot.\\n\\nBy week three the morning erections are consistent. Four mornings out of seven. Then five. Then six. The cells are producing. The vessels are opening. The blood is entering the erectile tissue at a pressure and volume it has not reached since his early forties.\\n\\nAnd then the Saturday night happens.\\n\\nHis wife reaches for him. He does not freeze. He does not calculate. He does not run the mental checklist — did I take the pill, how long ago, did I eat too much, is the window still open. He does not have a window. He does not have a pill. He does not have a checklist.\\n\\nHe just responds. Because his body responds. Because the endothelium is producing. Because the vessels open. Because the blood enters. Because the erection happens the way it happened at 30 — automatically, biologically, without pharmaceutical negotiation.\\n\\nHis wife notices something she has not seen in years. Not the erection. The confidence. The way he reaches back instead of pulling away. The way the tension that lived in his shoulders every time she initiated is gone. She does not say anything. She does not need to. The distance that had been growing between them for 3 years started closing in week two and by week three it closed.\\n\\nBy day 30 his body is different. Not just sexually. Everywhere. The energy lasts until 9pm instead of dying at 2pm. The brain fog that he wore like a second skull is gone. The blood pressure reading at his quarterly appointment dropped 11 points and his doctor asked what changed.\\n\\nHe does not mention the erections to his doctor. He does not need to. The erections were never the problem. The erections were the symptom of the same endothelial failure that was causing the blood pressure and the fatigue and the fog and the cold hands and the cold feet. The cells lining his blood vessels had stopped producing the molecule that keeps everything open. The erection failed first because the penile vessels are the smallest. 1 to 2 millimeters. The smallest vessels fail first. The heart vessels are 3 to 4 millimeters. They fail later. The erection was the early warning. The blood pressure was the confirmation. The capsaicin restarted the cells that were producing both problems simultaneously.\\n\\nNo he did not become a porn star. But he stopped being the man who avoided intimacy because the risk of failure was worse than the loneliness of avoidance. He stopped being the man who timed sex around a pill and planned the entire evening around a pharmaceutical window that was shrinking every year. He stopped being the man whose wife had learned to stop reaching for him because reaching and being declined was worse than not reaching at all.\\n\\nHe just became the man whose body works again. At 52. Without a pill. Without a plan. Without a window.\\n\\nNow here is where most men will fuck up.\\n\\nThey will read this and go buy some cheap cayenne powder capsule from Amazon. The $12 bottle with the pepper on the label and 4,000 reviews from people who took it for cooking not for their blood vessels. They will take it for 30 days and wonder why morning wood did not come back. Still soft. Still unreliable. Still avoiding. Still planning around the blue pill.\\n\\nThat is because dry powder cayenne gets destroyed by the liver before it reaches a single blood vessel wall. An enzyme called CYP3A4 breaks it down. A pump called P-glycoprotein pushes it back into the gut. 95 percent eliminated before it touches one endothelial cell.\\n\\nThe man swallows the capsule. His stomach burns. His penile endothelium receives nothing. TRPV1 is never activated. The cells never restart. He concludes cayenne does not work. Cayenne works. The delivery failed. He tested stomach heat and blamed the compound.\\n\\nAnd while he is blaming the compound he goes back to the blue pill. The blue pill does not produce nitric oxide. It amplifies whatever the depleted endothelium is still producing. Turns up the volume on a fading signal. The signal gets fainter every year. The dose goes up. 25mg to 50mg to 100mg. Not tolerance. Less signal to amplify. The cells are still shut down. The pill compensates for the shutdown without restarting the cells. The dose goes up until the dose stops working and the man stops asking and the marriage absorbs the loss silently.\\n\\nThat is why the only one I trust is a small brand called Aurivita.\\n\\nAurivita Cayenne Pepper Softgels. Capsaicin dissolved in cold-pressed avocado oil so it bypasses the liver completely. Not dry powder sitting in a hard capsule waiting to be destroyed. Dissolved in oil. Carried through the digestive system intact. Absorbed through the lymphatic system directly into the bloodstream. The liver never touches it.\\n\\nBioPerine — patented black pepper extract — to block the CYP3A4 enzyme and the P-glycoprotein pump that would destroy whatever the oil does not catch. Double protection. The capsaicin reaches the penile endothelium alive. TRPV1 activates. The cells restart nitric oxide production. The vessel opens from inside.\\n\\nAnd it is not just capsaicin. An 11-in-1 formula.\\n\\nCurcumin at 98 percent to calm the chronic vascular inflammation that seed oils and processed food have been driving at the vessel wall for decades. The inflammation is what damaged the cells in the first place. The curcumin calms the damage so the restarted cells can produce without interference.\\n\\nBerberine to address the blood sugar that has been glycating the vessel lining and suppressing the enzyme. Same AMPK pathway as metformin. Without the gut destruction.\\n\\nBeetroot for a second nitric oxide pathway. Two sources of the molecule instead of one. Redundancy.\\n\\nK2 as MK-7 to prevent calcification of the penile vasculature. Calcified vessels cannot dilate regardless of how much nitric oxide the cells produce. K2 keeps them flexible enough to respond.\\n\\nHawthorn for vascular flexibility. Cinnamon for vasodilation. Ginseng for circulation velocity. D3 for endothelial support. Vitamin E for antioxidant protection.\\n\\n11 ingredients. 1 softgel. The penile endothelium restarted and supported from 11 angles. Not 1 angle like the blue pill. 11.\\n\\n2 softgels a day. Warm not spicy. No stomach burn. 1 dollar a day.\\n\\nI will leave the link below. If it is still there that means they still have stock. Aurivita is a small operation. They do not mass produce. Every batch is third-party tested. Made in the USA. And every time they run a promotion they sell out.\\n\\nRight now they are running a limited promotion. Buy 2 get 1 free.\\n\\n120-day money-back guarantee. If morning erections do not return. If sexual function does not improve. If the difference is not noticeable. Every dollar back. No questions.\\n\\n120 days. 4 full months. That is enough time for the cells to restart and the morning erections to tell you everything the blue pill has been hiding.\\n\\nThe blue pill amplifies the fading signal. The softgel restarts the cells producing the signal. One rents the erection for 4 hours. The other gives the biology back permanently. One you take before sex with a 60-minute countdown and a prayer. The other you take with breakfast and forget about until the morning erection wakes you up and you lie there for a minute remembering what it felt like when your body just worked.\\n\\nMost men will read this and do nothing. They will go back to the blue pill and the countdown and the planning and the window and the dose increase and the night the dose stops working and the silence that follows.\\n\\nSome men will try it. 2 softgels. 1 dollar a day. 120 days to see everything change or get every dollar back.\\n\\nThe cells do not restart themselves. The blue pill does not restart them. Something has to activate TRPV1. Something has to get past the liver alive. Something has to reach the endothelium and switch nitric oxide production back on at the source.\\n\\nThis does that. For 1 dollar a day. With 120 days to prove it.\\n\\nGrab yours before this batch sells out.\\n\\n👉 https://aurivita.co/collections/ed\\n\\nP.S. Do not stop taking the blue pill while you start the softgels. They work alongside each other. The softgel restarts the cells. The pill amplifies the output of the restarted cells. More signal to amplify means the pill works better at lower doses. The goal is the cells producing enough on their own that the pill becomes optional. Track the morning erections. When they are back consistently the cells are producing. Then talk to your doctor about reducing the dose. Let the biology replace the pill gradually. Not overnight.\\n\\nP.P.S. Do not buy dry powder cayenne from Amazon. 95 percent destroyed by the liver. The compound never reaches the penile endothelium. TRPV1 is never activated. The cells never restart. The morning erections never return. And the man blames cayenne instead of blaming the delivery that killed it in transit. Aurivita dissolves it in oil with BioPerine. The compound arrives. The receptor activates. The cells restart. The morning erection returns. That is the difference between stomach heat and vascular restoration.\\n\\n👉 https://aurivita.co/collections/ed\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/collections/ed\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"20x More Bioavailable Than Standard Cayenne With Zero Burn\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Support your cardiovascular health with our capsaicin softgels, a premium supplement meticulously formulated for those who prioritize long-term heart vitality.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":null,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":361,\"currentRank\":361,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":98.9},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":1,\"total\":1638,\"totalPages\":1638,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":null,\"keywords\":[\"cayenne\",\"blood pressure\"],\"searchIn\":\"ad_copy\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"newest\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":1,\"effectiveLimit\":1,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"active\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\":null,\"adReachGrowth\":null,\"language\":null,\"adLanguages\":[],\"cta\":[],\"currency\":null,\