{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013JstLgPc6uQK85r1ED3LhN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"ef3bc9ed-446e-4c85-a1f0-83bfea8ea884\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1534708128698428\",\"collationId\":\"2245410242661823\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-30T04:44:30.169Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-07-28T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-11T05:07:29.413Z\",\"daysRunning\":119,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/f0efaad4a3896f7281b5a8070bcefb8fd11d9596baf6e4e83a9a41c197301c40.png\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"944867892040477\",\"name\":\"Men's Health Insider\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/944867892040477.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"944867892040477\",\"liveAdsCount\":530,\"reach30d\":268368,\"totalReach\":3971285,\"countriesCount\":28,\"facebookLikes\":1604,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"What Happens When You Can't Properly F*ck a Younger Woman (My Honest Story)\\n\\nFor anyone wondering if age gaps are the problem when you can't get hard, here's what happened to me.\\n\\nI'm 52. Got divorced at 50. Started dating a 34-year-old woman named Sarah six months ago. Smart, gorgeous, completely into me. Everything was perfect until the first time we tried to have sex.\\n\\nNothing happened.\\n\\nShe was patient. Understanding. Said it happens to everyone. But I was f*cking humiliated.\\n\\nI thought maybe it was nerves. First time jitters. Performance anxiety because she's younger and I wanted to impress her.\\n\\nSo we tried again a week later.\\n\\nNothing.\\n\\nThen a third time. Still nothing.\\n\\nBy the fourth attempt, I could see it in her eyes. The patience was wearing thin. Not because she was shallow, but because she was starting to wonder if I was even attracted to her.\\n\\nI told her I needed some space. Didn't give her a real reason. Just said I was dealing with some health stuff.\\n\\nWhat I actually said to myself was: \\\"I will never try to have sex again until I fix this. I'm not going to keep embarrassing myself and disappointing women who deserve better.\\\"\\n\\nI felt like a failure. Like my body had betrayed me right when I finally had a chance to start over.\\n\\nHere's what I tried:\\n\\nBought Viagra online. Worked once, then gave me a splitting headache and made my face turn red. Sarah noticed and asked if I was okay. Mortifying.\\n\\nTried those gas station pills. Nothing.\\n\\nCut out alcohol completely. Still nothing.\\n\\nStarted doing kegel exercises like some Reddit thread suggested. Waste of time.\\n\\nI was convinced the problem was in my head. Performance anxiety. Fear of failure. Psychological block because she's younger and I felt inadequate.\\n\\nThree months went by. I stopped returning Sarah's texts. She eventually stopped reaching out.\\n\\nI felt like shit about it, but I couldn't face her until I fixed myself.\\n\\nHere's what changed everything.\\n\\nI finally went to my doctor. Told him the whole story. The younger girlfriend. The repeated failures. The humiliation. I was expecting him to prescribe me Cialis and send me on my way.\\n\\nInstead, he asked a question that caught me off guard.\\n\\n\\\"How old are you?\\\"\\n\\n\\\"52.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"And when was the last time you had consistently strong erections?\\\"\\n\\nI had to think about it. \\\"Honestly? Probably my early forties.\\\"\\n\\nHe nodded like he'd heard this a thousand times.\\n\\n\\\"It's not the age gap. It's not performance anxiety. And it's definitely not in your head. It's your nitric oxide production. After your mid-thirties, your body stops making enough nitric oxide to open your blood vessels properly. Nitric oxide is the molecule that controls blood flow to your penis and to your other vital organs. Without it, doesn't matter how turned on you are or how attractive the woman is. No nitric oxide, no blood flow, no erection.\\\"\\n\\nI just stared at him.\\n\\n\\\"So you're saying it's not because I'm nervous?\\\"\\n\\n\\\"No. It's because your circulation is aging. The blood vessels aren't relaxing and expanding like they used to. This is actually an early warning sign that your cardiovascular system is declining. It's not about the woman. It's not about your confidence. It's about biology.\\\"\\n\\nI didn't know whether to feel relieved or angry.\\n\\nI'd spent three months convinced I was broken. That I'd ruined a good thing because of some psychological hang-up. That I was too old to date younger women.\\n\\nAnd it was just my f*cking circulation the whole time.\\n\\nHe explained how it works. After your mid-thirties, two things happen that cause what he called the Nitric Oxide Collapse:\\n\\nDepleted Receptor Activation: Your grandfather's diet included spicy peppers, capsaicin-rich traditional cuisines, hot chili in nearly every meal. That kept a receptor called TRPV1 constantly activated in his blood vessels. TRPV1 activation triggers nitric oxide production directly at the vessel wall. Modern processed food stripped that out. Your body lost the constant signal it needs to keep producing nitric oxide.\\n\\nBlood Sugar Sabotage: With the rise of processed foods and big food companies putting sugar in almost everything, blood sugar spikes have become chronic. And high blood sugar actively destroys nitric oxide. Every soda, every cereal, every \\\"healthy\\\" granola bar loaded with hidden sugar is quietly damaging the same molecule that keeps your erections working.\\n\\nPerformance anxiety doesn't cause either of those. Age does. A depleted food supply does. Chronic blood sugar spikes do. Declining circulation does.\\n\\nThen he told me the part that shocked me.\\n\\n\\\"There's a compound that reactivates TRPV1 directly and gets your endothelium — the cells lining your blood vessels — producing nitric oxide again. It's called pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin. Not the food-grade cayenne you have in your spice cabinet. Purified, concentrated capsaicin at the specific therapeutic dose the research used. David Julius at UCSF won the Nobel Prize in 2021 for the TRPV1 discovery. Since then, multiple studies have documented that 3mg of pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin per serving, dissolved in the specific oil that allows absorption, restores nitric oxide production, improves blood flow measurably, and reverses the exact vascular decline that's stopping your erections.\\\"\\n\\nI left his office and immediately ordered the cheapest cayenne capsules I could find. Big bottle off Amazon. Total pain to swallow but I didn't care. I needed to know if this was real.\\n\\nNothing happened.\\n\\nTurns out most cayenne products are garbage — food-grade powder in a dry capsule, dosed at trace amounts of the active capsaicin, loaded with fillers, no fat carrier so the compound never crosses the intestinal wall. Capsaicin is fat-soluble. Without a proper oil delivery vehicle it passes right through your gut without ever reaching your endothelium. I almost gave up and decided \\\"natural stuff just doesn't work.\\\"\\n\\nThen I found the studies my doctor was talking about. The clinical protocol used 3mg of pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin per serving, dissolved in cold-pressed avocado oil for absorption, with BioPerine to block hepatic first-pass metabolism. So I tracked down a brand that actually matched it.\\n\\nTwo and a half weeks into taking it, I woke up on a Saturday morning with a full erection pressing against my boxers. I just lay there staring at the ceiling, half in shock. It was the first time in years.\\n\\nThree weeks in, it kept happening. Nearly every morning.\\n\\nFour weeks in, I texted Sarah. Apologized for disappearing. Asked if she wanted to get dinner.\\n\\nShe said yes.\\n\\nWe went back to her place after. I was nervous as hell. But this time, everything worked.\\n\\nNot just worked. It was effortless. Strong. Lasted as long as I needed it to. Made her cum twice.\\n\\nWhen we finished, she looked at me and smiled. \\\"Whatever you did, keep doing it.\\\"\\n\\nI didn't tell her what had been happening. I just kissed her and said \\\"I'm sorry I disappeared.\\\"\\n\\nHere's the part nobody talks about.\\n\\nThe physical fix was huge. But the mental weight that lifted? That was something else.\\n\\nFor months I'd been carrying shame. Thinking I was too old to date younger women. Thinking my body had quit on me. Thinking I'd embarrassed myself beyond repair.\\n\\nI wasn't broken. My body was just trying to tell me my circulation was failing, that it was starving for the TRPV1 activation my grandfather's diet gave him constantly and my modern diet doesn't. And it's fixable.\\n\\nHunting down a pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin extract that was actually dosed right and properly delivered wasn't easy. I found Aurivita Capsaicin Power — pharmaceutical-grade capsaicin at 3mg per serving, dissolved in cold-pressed avocado oil so the fat-soluble compound actually absorbs, with BioPerine to block hepatic breakdown, K2 to prevent calcium deposition during vessel repair, D3, hawthorn, beetroot for nitric oxide substrate amplification, and Korean Red Ginseng. Deep amber softgels. Distributed by Azeal Supplements LLC. Third-party tested.\\n\\nIt's the one I keep taking every morning because it actually works.\\n\\nSarah and I are still together. And I don't worry anymore. Because I know now it was never about her age. It was never about my confidence.\\n\\nIt was just biology. And biology can be fixed.\\n\\nIf you're avoiding intimacy because you're scared you won't perform... if you've failed with someone and can't stop replaying it in your head... if you think you're too old to date younger women…\\n\\nYou're probably not broken. You just need to fix the nitric oxide collapse. It's happening to most men as they age, because the food supply stopped giving us what our grandfathers got naturally. And it's reversible.\\n\\nStop carrying shame that isn't yours to carry.\\n\\nIt wasn't your confidence. It wasn't the age gap. It was just your cardiovascular system sending you a warning. And it's fixable.\\n\\nThe link to what I used is here: aurivita.co/products/capsaicin-power-ed\\n\\nI wasted three months thinking I was broken. You don't have to.\\n\\nP.S. — Aurivita comes with a 120-day money-back guarantee. If you don't see morning wood return, if you can't get and stay hard as long as you need, and don't see real improvement... send it back for a full refund, no questions asked. You have nothing to lose.\\n\\nP.P.S. — Fair warning: Aurivita only sells through aurivita.co. Any Amazon listing you see is counterfeit — pale-yellow softgels instead of deep amber, cheap oil instead of cold-pressed avocado oil, no warmth in the chest within twenty minutes because the active compound isn't in it. When their real site sells out, there is a wait for the next batch. If you click and they're out of stock, I'm sorry. But if they're still in stock, I suggest you get yours now while you still can.\\n\\naurivita.co/products/capsaicin-power-ed\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://aurivita.co/pages/adv-general-ed-listicle\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"aurivita.co\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Nobody At My Doctor's Office Talks About This.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Support your cardiovascular health with our capsaicin softgels, a premium supplement meticulously formulated for those who prioritize long-term heart vitality.\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":145343,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":1308,\"duplicates\":12,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":24,\"reachDelta30d\":2075},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"BE\",\"BL\",\"CA\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"HK\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IT\",\"JP\",\"KR\",\"MY\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"PF\",\"PL\",\"PT\",\"SE\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"